<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:03.300" style="s2">Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.200" end="00:00:04.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the son the Prescotts lost years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.300" end="00:00:06.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on,</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.700" end="00:00:08.000" style="s2">you&#39;ll have the best of everything.</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.300" end="00:00:09.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought coming home and I&#39;d finally</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.000" end="00:00:12.600" style="s2">have a family. I was wrong. They gave</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.900" end="00:00:14.900" style="s2">all their love to Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:17.400" style="s2">They left me to die in that basement,</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.900" end="00:00:19.000" style="s2">then dumped my body in the river.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.400" end="00:00:21.400" style="s2">Then I woke up as the richest man in New</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">York. This time the Prescotts are going</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.400" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">to pay in blood.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.200" end="00:00:30.600" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.800" end="00:00:50.900" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.200" end="00:00:57.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat up. You&#39;re way too skinny.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.300" end="00:01:01.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Tina.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:01.100" style="s2">Mom, help me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.400" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">A snake bit me. I need to get to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.400" end="00:01:08.900" style="s2">hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.000" end="00:01:12.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is wrong with you now?</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.900" end="00:01:13.700" style="s2">A snake in this house? Give me a break.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">This isn&#39;t the back hoods you crawled</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:17.200" style="s2">out of.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.100" end="00:01:20.600" style="s2">You lie about everything. Is playing the</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.200" end="00:01:20.600" style="s2">victim ALL YOU KNOW HOW TO DO?</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.300" end="00:01:23.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.700" end="00:01:25.600" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.900" end="00:01:29.300" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.600" end="00:01:32.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop the act. You&#39;re [ __ ] disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.300" end="00:01:35.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t be mad at him. Maybe he just</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.300" end="00:01:36.500" style="s2">wants your attention. It&#39;s my fault. I</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.100" end="00:01:38.400" style="s2">took his place.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.500" end="00:01:40.300" style="s2">He&#39;s your real son.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.400" end="00:01:43.000" style="s2">I&#39;m just adopted.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.300" end="00:01:44.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, don&#39;t ever say that. You&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.000" end="00:01:46.200" style="s2">son, too.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t even compare yourself to Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.200" end="00:01:50.300" style="s2">He&#39;s still defending someone like you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:50.300" style="s2">Now get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.971" end="00:01:55.991" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.500" end="00:02:00.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Police estates. I I got by a snake.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.892" end="00:02:05.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That kind of venomous snake? I&#39;ve never</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.692" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">seen one in the city.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.892" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that&#39;s weird.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.292" end="00:02:15.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve got the venom under control,</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.092" end="00:02:17.892" style="s2">but your blood work</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.092" end="00:02:17.892" style="s2">showed something else.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.392" end="00:02:28.592" style="s2">It&#39;s serious. You need to be admitted</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.192" end="00:02:30.092" style="s2">right away and start preparing for a</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.592" end="00:02:31.692" style="s2">bone marrow transplant. Without</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.092" end="00:02:33.192" style="s2">treatment, you could die.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.692" end="00:02:36.392" style="s2">And the ER and anti-venom bill needs to</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.192" end="00:02:36.392" style="s2">be settled as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.292" end="00:02:48.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Prescott said she doesn&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.792" end="00:02:48.792" style="s2">see you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.492" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.792" end="00:02:52.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She also left you a message. A gutter</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:56.192" style="s2">rat like you belongs in the basement.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.892" end="00:02:56.192" style="s2">Now get out of my sight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:02.892" style="s2">You [ __ ] death.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:02.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET LOST.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.607" end="00:03:13.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.092" end="00:03:16.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHY?</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:16.692" style="s2">WHY DID YOU NEVER BELIEVE IN ME?</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.087" end="00:03:23.107" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.992" end="00:03:30.192" style="s2">What</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.292" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">What&#39;s happening to me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.092" end="00:03:41.292" style="s2">Five years, I did everything I could to</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.592" end="00:03:45.592" style="s2">make you proud.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.292" end="00:03:45.592" style="s2">I&#39;m your son. I&#39;m your own son.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.892" end="00:03:49.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.592" end="00:03:52.492" style="s2">After all these years, my son Colin is</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.992" end="00:03:54.592" style="s2">finally home. He suffered enough for one</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.492" end="00:03:55.892" style="s2">lifetime. We owe him more than we could</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.592" end="00:03:57.892" style="s2">ever repay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.892" end="00:04:00.692" style="s2">From this day on, he &#39;ll have the best</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.892" end="00:04:02.292" style="s2">of everything. The best home, the The</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.692" end="00:04:04.994" style="s2">education.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.292" end="00:04:06.594" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure my son, the happiest kid</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.994" end="00:04:08.094" style="s2">in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.594" end="00:04:10.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never knew that would be the last time</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.094" end="00:04:12.194" style="s2">I truly smiled in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.194" end="00:04:14.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Answer me. Did you steal your brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.194" end="00:04:14.694" style="s2">watch?</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.894" end="00:04:19.694" style="s2">Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.094" end="00:04:20.694" style="s2">Why the hell was Damian&#39;s watch under</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.694" end="00:04:23.094" style="s2">your pillow?</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.694" end="00:04:24.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I didn&#39;t do it. I I never even</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:26.994" style="s2">touched it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.094" end="00:04:29.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t be mad. Maybe he never saw</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.994" end="00:04:31.594" style="s2">anything this nice in foster care. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.194" end="00:04:33.094" style="s2">he just wanted to look.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.594" end="00:04:35.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caught red-handed and you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.094" end="00:04:37.294" style="s2">lying? Figures. You&#39;re still the same</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.494" end="00:04:39.794" style="s2">gutter trash we pulled out of foster</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.294" end="00:04:39.794" style="s2">care.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.994" end="00:04:43.094" style="s2">I&#39;ll beat the Prescott rules into you</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.694" end="00:04:45.694" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.094" end="00:04:47.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I swear. I didn&#39;t do it. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.694" end="00:04:47.894" style="s2">Damian left it there and forgot about</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.094" end="00:04:49.594" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.894" end="00:04:53.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You steal from your brother then blame</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.594" end="00:04:53.494" style="s2">him? You little bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.994" end="00:04:58.294" style="s2">GET THE [ __ ] OUT. YOU DON&#39;T STEP foot in</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:05:01.294" style="s2">this house again. Go sleep in the</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.294" end="00:05:03.894" style="s2">basement where you belong.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.294" end="00:05:07.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A year passed and I still foolishly</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:10.994" style="s2">believed that if I tried hard enough,</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:10.994" style="s2">one day they&#39;d finally accept me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.394" end="00:05:17.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A national competition? You designed</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.594" end="00:05:19.494" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.494" end="00:05:22.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My teacher says it&#39;s really good. If I</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.494" end="00:05:22.894" style="s2">win, I could even get a scholarship.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.594" end="00:05:27.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said you could come in here?</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.294" end="00:05:42.894" style="s2">You can barely keep up in school and now</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.194" end="00:05:45.594" style="s2">you want to go national? You want to</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.894" end="00:05:47.194" style="s2">drag the Prescott name down with you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.594" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But my teacher said my rocket propulsion</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.194" end="00:05:49.994" style="s2">design</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:51.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bolt together some junk and call</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.994" end="00:05:53.994" style="s2">that a design? Living here doesn&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:57.394" style="s2">you Damian&#39;s equal. You&#39;re still that</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.994" end="00:05:59.694" style="s2">same trash we dragged in off the street.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.394" end="00:06:02.494" style="s2">Get back to your basement. I&#39;m sick of</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.694" end="00:06:02.494" style="s2">looking at you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.694" end="00:06:10.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, did you finish packing for your</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.095" end="00:06:13.695" style="s2">graduation trip? We can go shopping</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.195" end="00:06:13.695" style="s2">tomorrow for whatever you still need.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.995" end="00:06:19.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A national competition?</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.295" end="00:06:22.895" style="s2">You seriously think that pile of junk</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.795" end="00:06:25.095" style="s2">is going to make dad proud of you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.895" end="00:06:27.195" style="s2">Move. Mad? Then you&#39;re going to love</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.095" end="00:06:29.695" style="s2">this. I put that watch under your</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.195" end="00:06:29.695" style="s2">pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:35.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? I never tried to take anything from</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.795" end="00:06:37.095" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.095" end="00:06:39.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The second you came back, you started</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:41.495" style="s2">taking what&#39;s mine. Too bad.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.595" end="00:06:43.695" style="s2">I shed a few tears. Dad calls you a</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:45.695" style="s2">thief. I say you hurt me. Mom thinks</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.695" end="00:06:47.995" style="s2">you&#39;re [ __ ] crazy. I could frame you</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.695" end="00:06:49.695" style="s2">right to your [ __ ] face and they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.995" end="00:06:51.995" style="s2">still believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.695" end="00:06:52.995" style="s2">Get it, freak? The Prescotts only need</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.995" end="00:06:54.295" style="s2">one son.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.995" end="00:06:55.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.295" end="00:06:56.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.195" end="00:06:59.795" style="s2">You can rot in that basement like the</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.695" end="00:06:59.795" style="s2">stray dog you are.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.195" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.395" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">That&#39;s all it took to break you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.695" end="00:07:10.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN, DON&#39;T PUSH ME!</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.060" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.695" end="00:07:30.695" style="s2">COLIN,</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.695" end="00:07:30.695" style="s2">DON&#39;T PUSH ME!</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.995" end="00:07:41.695" style="s2">NO!</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.695" end="00:07:51.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAMIAN, BABY, what happened?</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.395" end="00:07:52.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.595" end="00:07:54.795" style="s2">Colin [snorts] lost it over the</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.595" end="00:07:57.095" style="s2">application. He tried to shove me down</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.795" end="00:07:59.395" style="s2">the stairs. I barely caught the railing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.095" end="00:08:01.195" style="s2">Then he slipped and fell.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.395" end="00:08:03.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go check on him. I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.195" end="00:08:05.695" style="s2">Really.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.295" end="00:08:08.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I didn&#39;t push him. I swear I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.695" end="00:08:11.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little monster. We saw</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.097" end="00:08:11.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you did and you&#39;re still lying?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.897" end="00:08:17.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know what you were really like, I would</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.197" end="00:08:17.697" style="s2">have left you in foster scare.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:21.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget him.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.997" end="00:08:24.197" style="s2">Damian needs a hospital now. I won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.097" end="00:08:24.197" style="s2">this scar him for life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.595" end="00:08:31.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.497" end="00:08:36.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.525" end="00:08:36.297" style="s2">[snorts] Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.397" end="00:08:39.697" style="s2">I think I broke something too.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.597" end="00:08:42.297" style="s2">Please</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.697" end="00:08:42.297" style="s2">don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.897" end="00:09:03.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, dad?</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.897" end="00:09:04.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m really sick.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.597" end="00:09:07.997" style="s2">It&#39;s leukemia.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.997" end="00:09:09.297" style="s2">I need a bone marrow transplant.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.997" end="00:09:10.897" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.297" end="00:09:12.797" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.897" end="00:09:14.997" style="s2">Please help me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:16.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collin, are you done yet? Damian already</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.997" end="00:09:18.097" style="s2">told us you&#39;ve been out there causing</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.397" end="00:09:19.197" style="s2">trouble again. Now you&#39;re faking some</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:20.297" style="s2">illness for money?</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.197" end="00:09:21.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.297" end="00:09:24.397" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.697" end="00:09:25.297" style="s2">It&#39;s real. Call the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.397" end="00:09:27.197" style="s2">They&#39;ll tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.297" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. You&#39;ve shamed this family</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.197" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">enough. Don&#39;t ever pull this [ __ ] again.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.476" end="00:09:34.496" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.097" end="00:09:51.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.397" end="00:09:53.497" style="s2">Open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.097" end="00:09:53.497" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.697" end="00:10:00.197" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:02.297" style="s2">I&#39;m dying out here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.197" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">Please take me to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.297" end="00:10:04.797" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.897" end="00:10:08.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.997" end="00:10:10.698" style="s2">Don&#39;t let that psycho in. Did you forget</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.197" end="00:10:12.998" style="s2">what he did to Damian? What if he snaps</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.698" end="00:10:14.498" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.998" end="00:10:16.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay, Tina.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.498" end="00:10:17.898" style="s2">Maybe Colin didn&#39;t mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.498" end="00:10:19.198" style="s2">It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.898" end="00:10:21.098" style="s2">Dad said he&#39;s been running around</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.198" end="00:10:23.598" style="s2">outside again. I&#39;m scared he might</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.098" end="00:10:25.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he was lying again. Nobody opens</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.598" end="00:10:28.498" style="s2">that door. Let him stay out there and</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.398" end="00:10:28.498" style="s2">think about what he&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.598" end="00:10:36.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.998" end="00:10:37.798" style="s2">Why are you doing this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.298" end="00:10:40.698" style="s2">I would have been better off staying in</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.798" end="00:10:40.698" style="s2">foster care.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.002" end="00:11:16.022" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.498" end="00:11:27.757" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you ever believe me? I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.498" end="00:11:29.777" style="s2">true son. We share the same blood.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.757" end="00:11:29.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.998" end="00:11:34.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, welcome home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.598" end="00:11:36.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this day on, he&#39;ll have the best of</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.598" end="00:11:39.498" style="s2">everything. Answer me. Did you steal</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.898" end="00:11:42.098" style="s2">your brother&#39;s watch?</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.498" end="00:11:45.298" style="s2">You little bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.098" end="00:11:45.298" style="s2">Who said you could come in here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.998" end="00:11:53.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you little monster? We saw what you</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.598" end="00:11:53.298" style="s2">did and you&#39;re still lying?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.598" end="00:11:58.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.498" end="00:12:00.798" style="s2">This is what you call home?</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:12:02.998" style="s2">If I get another life, I don&#39;t want you</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.798" end="00:12:04.698" style="s2">as my parents.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.998" end="00:12:07.498" style="s2">I don&#39;t want any of you as my family</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.698" end="00:12:07.498" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.798" end="00:12:17.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN, I YELL AT you once AND NOW YOU</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.199" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">WON&#39;T EVEN SEE ME NOW? GET UP and open</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.199" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">this door.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.799" end="00:12:25.299" style="s2">Collin?</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.599" end="00:12:33.599" style="s2">Collin, I&#39;m talking to you. You hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.599" end="00:12:34.899" style="s2">I had Rosa waiting for you last night</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.599" end="00:12:36.899" style="s2">and she said you saw her and walked</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.899" end="00:12:38.499" style="s2">away. What the hell is this attitude? We</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.899" end="00:12:39.808" style="s2">pulled you out of foster care and gave</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.499" end="00:12:40.899" style="s2">you a home.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.808" end="00:12:42.999" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.899" end="00:12:47.099" style="s2">And all you&#39;ve done is bully Damian and</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.999" end="00:12:49.299" style="s2">cause trouble. IS THIS HOW YOU REPAY US?</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.099" end="00:12:52.599" style="s2">And look at this mess. I&#39;m talking to</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.299" end="00:12:52.599" style="s2">you. Answer me!</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.099" end="00:13:00.499" style="s2">Were you out screwing around in some</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.899" end="00:13:00.499" style="s2">[ __ ] HOLE AGAIN LAST NIGHT?</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.699" end="00:13:04.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOM, my friend saw Collin at a bar with</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.599" end="00:13:07.399" style="s2">some sketchy people. And he told you he</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.499" end="00:13:09.599" style="s2">was at the hospital? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.399" end="00:13:11.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, you&#39;re so pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.599" end="00:13:13.299" style="s2">I told you to keep your head down and</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.199" end="00:13:16.399" style="s2">stop humiliating this family and now</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.299" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">you&#39;re here playing dead? Stop the act.</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.399" end="00:13:20.199" style="s2">Get up and tell me where the hell you</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.499" end="00:13:20.199" style="s2">were last night.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.199" end="00:13:27.699" style="s2">I knew it. You got into another fight,</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.499" end="00:13:31.199" style="s2">didn&#39;t you? Look at you. You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.699" end="00:13:31.199" style="s2">disgrace to this family.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.399" end="00:13:34.399" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.299" end="00:13:38.099" style="s2">Rot in here for all I care.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.399" end="00:13:38.099" style="s2">I wish I&#39;d never had a son like you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.299" end="00:13:50.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you look exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.499" end="00:13:53.299" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you sleep last night?</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.399" end="00:13:54.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That ungrateful little [ __ ] I went down</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.299" end="00:13:55.799" style="s2">there</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.199" end="00:13:56.799" style="s2">to check on him</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.799" end="00:13:59.199" style="s2">and</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.799" end="00:14:01.199" style="s2">he wouldn&#39;t even answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.199" end="00:14:04.799" style="s2">And last night, he came home and</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.199" end="00:14:04.799" style="s2">couldn&#39;t even bother to come see me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.999" end="00:14:12.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosa, when Collin gets back,</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.699" end="00:14:15.999" style="s2">tell him mom doesn&#39;t want to see him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.599" end="00:14:15.999" style="s2">Send him straight back to the basement.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.399" end="00:14:19.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry,</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.701" end="00:14:21.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.201" end="00:14:22.701" style="s2">I kept telling myself we owed Colin. So,</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.401" end="00:14:24.801" style="s2">every time he screwed up, I let it</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.701" end="00:14:27.101" style="s2">slide. And for what? All he does is run</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.801" end="00:14:28.901" style="s2">around, lie, beg us for money, and pick</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.101" end="00:14:29.901" style="s2">fights. There&#39;s nothing Prescott about</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.901" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.901" end="00:14:34.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t be mad. Colin just grew up in</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:37.401" style="s2">foster care.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.501" end="00:14:40.101" style="s2">Maybe maybe he was just out too late and</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.401" end="00:14:40.101" style="s2">got tired.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.601" end="00:14:49.501" style="s2">Maybe maybe he was just out too late and</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.501" end="00:14:51.701" style="s2">got tired and</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.501" end="00:14:53.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tired? Please, he&#39;s doing this just to</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.701" end="00:14:55.201" style="s2">piss me off.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.201" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom Mom, he&#39;s not worth getting worked</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.201" end="00:14:58.001" style="s2">up over.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.101" end="00:15:01.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Do we really have to talk about</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.001" end="00:15:03.201" style="s2">him at dinner? I&#39;m losing my appetite.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.901" end="00:15:06.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.201" end="00:15:08.401" style="s2">Mom Tina don&#39;t blame Colin. Maybe if I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.601" end="00:15:08.501" style="s2">tried harder to talk to him, he wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.401" end="00:15:11.501" style="s2">have</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.501" end="00:15:13.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, none of this is your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.501" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">From now on, just leave him alone. Let</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.701" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">him fend for himself.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.180" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.501" end="00:15:30.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is that smell? Have Rosa</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.401" end="00:15:33.301" style="s2">take out the trash.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.801" end="00:15:33.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosa</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.701" end="00:15:38.301" style="s2">Rosa, did you leave trash out back</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.201" end="00:15:40.401" style="s2">again? It reeks in here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.301" end="00:15:42.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, we already cleaned everything</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.401" end="00:15:44.701" style="s2">this morning. I think</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.301" end="00:15:46.201" style="s2">it&#39;s coming it&#39;s coming from Colin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.701" end="00:15:48.701" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.201" end="00:15:50.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t blame Colin. He&#39;s never</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.701" end="00:15:51.501" style="s2">exactly been the cleanest.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:55.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Him again?</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.501" end="00:15:55.601" style="s2">Go tell him to clean that [ __ ] up now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.901" end="00:16:02.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t get upset. He&#39;s not worth it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.501" end="00:16:05.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, he&#39;d feel right at home in a</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.401" end="00:16:08.101" style="s2">dumpster.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.801" end="00:16:09.501" style="s2">Forget him. Damian, didn&#39;t you and mom</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.101" end="00:16:12.201" style="s2">and dad visit the Cass family in</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.501" end="00:16:15.101" style="s2">Philadelphia? What&#39;s Anne like?</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.201" end="00:16:16.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina, she&#39;s awful. She&#39;s ugly, rude, and</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.101" end="00:16:18.001" style="s2">she talks to everyone like they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.301" end="00:16:20.802" style="s2">beneath her.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.001" end="00:16:21.902" style="s2">The Cass got rich what 5 minutes ago?</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.802" end="00:16:24.402" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.902" end="00:16:26.302" style="s2">mom, you seriously want me marrying</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.402" end="00:16:28.802" style="s2">someone like that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.302" end="00:16:30.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, the Cass family has money and</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.802" end="00:16:34.102" style="s2">connections. An alliance with them would</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.902" end="00:16:34.102" style="s2">make us stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.266" end="00:16:38.286" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.202" end="00:16:45.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, her family could help us, but you</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.302" end="00:16:47.602" style="s2">don&#39;t want Damian miserable, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.302" end="00:16:49.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. We&#39;ve raised Damian to take</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.602" end="00:16:52.202" style="s2">over someday. He deserves better than a</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.702" end="00:16:54.102" style="s2">life like that.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.202" end="00:16:56.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you forget Damian isn&#39;t our only</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.102" end="00:16:56.502" style="s2">son?</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.002" end="00:17:03.602" style="s2">Did you forget Damian isn&#39;t our only</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.302" end="00:17:05.102" style="s2">son?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.602" end="00:17:06.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.102" end="00:17:10.502" style="s2">How the hell did I forget about him?</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.902" end="00:17:10.502" style="s2">He&#39;s a Prescott by blood, too.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.402" end="00:17:16.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An unwanted foster kid and some new</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.602" end="00:17:17.702" style="s2">money princess?</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.202" end="00:17:18.902" style="s2">Perfect match.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.702" end="00:17:21.302" style="s2">And it gets him out of our house for</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.902" end="00:17:21.302" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.202" end="00:17:25.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think he&#39;ll go for it? Colin</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.002" end="00:17:26.302" style="s2">can be difficult.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.602" end="00:17:28.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.302" end="00:17:30.102" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t get a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.002" end="00:17:32.302" style="s2">We fed that useless bastard for years.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.102" end="00:17:33.802" style="s2">It&#39;s about time he paid us back.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:36.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin does fit the bill, but</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.802" end="00:17:37.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No buts. It&#39;s settled. We go to</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.202" end="00:17:39.302" style="s2">Philadelphia and lock this down with the</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.802" end="00:17:41.102" style="s2">Cass family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.302" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. At least this gives Colin</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.102" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">somewhere decent to end up.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.302" end="00:17:48.302" style="s2">Ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.302" end="00:17:50.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now?</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.302" end="00:17:51.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, the smell from the basement is</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.202" end="00:17:53.802" style="s2">getting really bad.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.702" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">I tried to go clean it, but Colin locked</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.802" end="00:17:58.802" style="s2">the door from inside.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.402" end="00:18:00.902" style="s2">Should I have someone break it open?</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.802" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He locked it? Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.902" end="00:18:04.202" style="s2">what if he&#39;s still mad at you and doing</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.902" end="00:18:05.402" style="s2">this on purpose?</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.202" end="00:18:07.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.402" end="00:18:09.402" style="s2">He&#39;s [ __ ] with me again. If he wants</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.402" end="00:18:13.602" style="s2">to lock himself in that filthy hole, let</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.402" end="00:18:13.602" style="s2">him rot! Nobody goes near him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.702" end="00:18:21.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. The Cass family agreed. At least</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.502" end="00:18:23.703" style="s2">that useless bastard finally has</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.003" end="00:18:23.703" style="s2">somewhere to go.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.103" end="00:18:28.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.503" end="00:18:31.403" style="s2">It&#39;s been reeking for two days, and</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.603" end="00:18:33.503" style="s2">somehow it&#39;s even worse out here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.403" end="00:18:34.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell has Rosa been doing?</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.503" end="00:18:36.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire her tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.903" end="00:18:37.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.203" end="00:18:40.003" style="s2">what if Colin&#39;s doing this to get back</p>
