<p begin="00:18:40.003" end="00:18:44.403" style="s2">and he locked her out, remember?</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.803" end="00:18:46.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, he never gives us a damn break.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.403" end="00:18:49.503" style="s2">Come on. We&#39;ll deal with this and tell</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.303" end="00:18:49.503" style="s2">him about the forced marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.103" end="00:18:56.003" style="s2">Colin, get your ass out here. You made</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.303" end="00:18:58.603" style="s2">this whole place stink just to [ __ ] with</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.003" end="00:18:58.603" style="s2">us, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.603" end="00:19:05.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Just open the damn door.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.813" end="00:19:14.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.303" end="00:19:25.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.803" end="00:19:27.933" style="s2">COLIN.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.303" end="00:19:27.933" style="s2">THAT&#39;S COLIN. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.503" end="00:19:35.403" style="s2">IT WAS ME. I KILLED HIM. FINE. Rot in</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.503" end="00:19:38.403" style="s2">here for all I care. I wish I&#39;d never</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:38.403" style="s2">had a son like you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.503" end="00:19:46.603" style="s2">I locked him in here. OH GOD, I KILLED</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.103" end="00:19:46.603" style="s2">HIM.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.703" end="00:19:51.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN,</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.803" end="00:19:51.903" style="s2">how how did this happen?</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.503" end="00:20:01.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get two men to the basement. Men who</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.003" end="00:20:03.103" style="s2">know how to keep their mouths shut now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.283" end="00:20:04.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.103" end="00:20:06.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut the [ __ ] up. You want the whole</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.603" end="00:20:10.003" style="s2">damn house down here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.303" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby, my boy. Mommy was wrong. I&#39;m so</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.003" end="00:20:13.703" style="s2">sorry. Please come back.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.403" end="00:20:16.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell?</p>
