<p begin="00:20:18.603" end="00:20:21.803" style="s2">single trace left.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.105" end="00:20:33.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.405" end="00:20:35.305" style="s2">This place is [ __ ] creepy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.505" end="00:20:37.905" style="s2">Quit whining. Dump him, get paid, and</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.305" end="00:20:37.905" style="s2">get the hell out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.405" end="00:20:46.105" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.479" end="00:20:48.499" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:52.505" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.905" end="00:20:55.805" style="s2">help me. I&#39;m so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.505" end="00:20:55.805" style="s2">It&#39;s so cold in the river.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.105" end="00:21:06.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Collin? Collin, is that you? I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.105" end="00:21:06.805" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.305" end="00:21:15.405" style="s2">Collin!</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.105" end="00:21:24.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.205" end="00:21:44.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away. Leave Collin. Don&#39;t come for</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.905" end="00:21:45.305" style="s2">me. Mommy was wrong. I know I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.205" end="00:21:47.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.305" end="00:21:51.005" style="s2">help me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.205" end="00:21:52.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is wrong with you now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.005" end="00:21:54.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.705" end="00:21:56.605" style="s2">I&#39;m dying out here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.505" end="00:21:59.105" style="s2">Please take me to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.605" end="00:21:59.105" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.705" end="00:22:06.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody opens that door. Let him stay out</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.305" end="00:22:09.305" style="s2">there and think about what he&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.205" end="00:22:12.905" style="s2">Fine. Rot in here for all I care.</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.305" end="00:22:12.905" style="s2">I wish I&#39;d never had a son like you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.605" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was [ __ ] blind. Collin was my own</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.505" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">son and I chose Damon OVER HIM. I LOCKED</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.905" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">MY OWN CHILD DOWN THERE. I LET HIM DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.970" end="00:22:31.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.406" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.506" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">MY BABY.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.340" end="00:23:09.006" style="s2">[laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.406" end="00:23:13.606" style="s2">WHAT THE hell was wrong with me? He was</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.006" end="00:23:13.606" style="s2">sick and I called him a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.006" end="00:23:22.506" style="s2">I never even gave him one decent meal.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.006" end="00:23:22.506" style="s2">Never bought him a single new shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.196" end="00:23:34.216" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.781" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">[gasps] Mommy was wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.006" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">Mommy was so wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.706" end="00:23:53.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.606" end="00:23:53.806" style="s2">it&#39;s freezing and filthy down here. Come</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.106" end="00:23:56.906" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.806" end="00:23:56.906" style="s2">Let me take you back upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.606" end="00:24:03.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.806" end="00:24:03.506" style="s2">You came back?</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.906" end="00:24:08.206" style="s2">I knew you&#39;d come back to mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.106" end="00:24:12.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.206" end="00:24:12.706" style="s2">wake the [ __ ] up. I&#39;m Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.506" end="00:24:19.106" style="s2">Colin&#39;s rotting at the bottom of the</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.906" end="00:24:22.106" style="s2">river feeding the fish. Colin is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.106" end="00:24:22.106" style="s2">He&#39;s never coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.206" end="00:24:32.707" style="s2">Colin&#39;s rotting at the bottom of the</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.607" end="00:24:35.076" style="s2">river, feeding the fish. Colin is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.707" end="00:24:35.807" style="s2">He&#39;s never coming back.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.076" end="00:24:36.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.807" end="00:24:41.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.807" end="00:24:41.207" style="s2">You&#39;re lying. My Colin isn&#39;t dead.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.107" end="00:24:44.207" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.507" end="00:24:50.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.207" end="00:24:52.107" style="s2">People are already asking what the hell</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.607" end="00:24:53.607" style="s2">happened in this family.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.107" end="00:24:56.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep this up and all of New York&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.607" end="00:24:56.908" style="s2">to know our dirty laundry.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.807" end="00:25:03.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take her upstairs and lock the door.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.707" end="00:25:06.307" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t come out without my</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.807" end="00:25:06.307" style="s2">permission.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.107" end="00:25:13.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go. Colin&#39;s still here. I need TO</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.607" end="00:25:13.507" style="s2">STAY WITH MY SON. COLIN.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.307" end="00:25:22.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAD, TINA.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.507" end="00:25:24.107" style="s2">Mom&#39;s not okay. She needs time. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.707" end="00:25:25.807" style="s2">all of Colin&#39;s stuff lying around is</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.107" end="00:25:27.007" style="s2">making it harder for her to move on.</p>
