<p begin="00:25:42.107" end="00:25:47.807" style="s2">Burn it all. Every last [ __ ] thing. I</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.307" end="00:25:47.807" style="s2">don&#39;t want a single piece left.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.507" end="00:25:55.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IDIOTS. WATCH WHAT YOU&#39;RE DOING.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.007" end="00:26:00.307" style="s2">WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.408" end="00:26:15.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This year&#39;s grand prize goes to the Mars</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.707" end="00:26:18.707" style="s2">One Rocket Propulsion System, designed</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.307" end="00:26:18.707" style="s2">by Colin Prescott.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.408" end="00:26:24.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Professor Miller.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.307" end="00:26:26.207" style="s2">If you hadn&#39;t fought to get me into this</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.607" end="00:26:29.307" style="s2">competition,</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.207" end="00:26:29.307" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t be standing here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.007" end="00:26:36.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I won grand prize. Professor Miller</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.009" end="00:26:37.909" style="s2">said if I keep studying, I could</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.509" end="00:26:38.709" style="s2">actually become an aerospace engineer</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.909" end="00:26:40.509" style="s2">someday.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.709" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell said you could enter?</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.509" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">You win one stupid prize and suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.309" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">think you can disobey me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.509" end="00:26:50.109" style="s2">Who the hell said you could enter?</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.309" end="00:26:53.309" style="s2">You win one stupid prize and suddenly</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.109" end="00:26:53.309" style="s2">think you can disobey me?</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.509" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, but this was a national</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.709" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">competition. My teacher said I really</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.909" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">have talent.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.209" end="00:27:12.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talent? You&#39;re some foster kid who can</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.009" end="00:27:13.809" style="s2">barely keep up in school and now you</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.309" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">think you&#39;re going to build rockets?</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.809" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">Keep the Prescott name out of your</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.109" end="00:27:18.309" style="s2">little fantasy. I already filed the</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:19.309" style="s2">paperwork. Starting tomorrow, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.309" end="00:27:20.609" style="s2">done with school.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.309" end="00:27:22.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One little prize and you think you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.609" end="00:27:26.309" style="s2">some big shot now? Quit school before</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.609" end="00:27:26.309" style="s2">you embarrass this family anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.109" end="00:27:32.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, please. I&#39;ll work harder. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.109" end="00:27:34.909" style="s2">catch up. Just don&#39;t make me quit</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.509" end="00:27:38.409" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.909" end="00:27:41.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, you were useless alive, but Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.409" end="00:27:41.909" style="s2">you finally left me something useful.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.109" end="00:27:45.309" style="s2">I&#39;ll take care of these. You keep</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.509" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">burning the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.309" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
