<p begin="00:28:04.109" end="00:28:07.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin,</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.409" end="00:28:09.909" style="s2">you poured your whole life into that</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.009" end="00:28:11.409" style="s2">rocket and propulsion system. So what?</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.909" end="00:28:14.009" style="s2">It&#39;s mine now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.409" end="00:28:15.409" style="s2">Your name, your future, everything you</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.009" end="00:28:17.309" style="s2">had,</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.409" end="00:28:19.009" style="s2">it&#39;s mine now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.309" end="00:28:21.054" style="s2">So watch from hell while I take the</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.009" end="00:28:23.074" style="s2">credit and the money.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.054" end="00:28:23.074" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.109" end="00:28:34.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been three years. There&#39;s almost no</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.909" end="00:28:35.710" style="s2">neurological response left.</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.710" end="00:28:39.410" style="s2">Mrs. Barrett, we recommend</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.710" end="00:28:39.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. We&#39;re not giving up on him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.110" end="00:28:47.410" style="s2">Doctor, he&#39;s responding.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.910" end="00:28:52.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.110" end="00:28:53.510" style="s2">that&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.210" end="00:28:57.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai,</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.510" end="00:28:57.110" style="s2">what&#39;s happening to my son?</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.010" end="00:29:02.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.210" end="00:29:02.410" style="s2">This is what you call home?</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.810" end="00:29:08.010" style="s2">Where</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.810" end="00:29:11.910" style="s2">am I?</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.010" end="00:29:11.910" style="s2">I I died, didn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.710" end="00:29:25.410" style="s2">Where</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.010" end="00:29:28.010" style="s2">am I? I</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.410" end="00:29:29.110" style="s2">I died, didn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.010" end="00:29:31.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai,</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.110" end="00:29:35.110" style="s2">you&#39;re awake. You&#39;re really awake. Mom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.810" end="00:29:35.110" style="s2">here. I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.610" end="00:29:42.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.310" end="00:29:44.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sweetheart. It&#39;s mom. You&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.010" end="00:29:47.910" style="s2">asleep for three years.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.210" end="00:29:48.810" style="s2">God finally gave you back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.910" end="00:29:50.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.810" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.310" end="00:29:54.910" style="s2">Kai, do you remember what happened</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.010" end="00:29:54.910" style="s2">before the accident?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.810" end="00:30:03.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] yeah. NOW THIS IS LIVING.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.110" end="00:30:05.810" style="s2">WOAH, DEAR.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.610" end="00:30:05.810" style="s2">WOOHOO.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.810" end="00:30:18.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KAI,</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.910" end="00:30:20.510" style="s2">KAI, ARE YOU OKAY? Please don&#39;t scare</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.310" end="00:30:22.310" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.510" end="00:30:24.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is insane.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.310" end="00:30:25.910" style="s2">I died in that basement</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.210" end="00:30:28.010" style="s2">and now I&#39;m alive again in some reckless</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.910" end="00:30:30.610" style="s2">rich kid&#39;s body.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.010" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">Guess I really did get a second chance.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.610" end="00:30:33.410" style="s2">Better not waste it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.312" end="00:30:47.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, Kai. Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:48.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lie about everything. Is playing the</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.312" end="00:30:51.712" style="s2">victim all you know how to do? You</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:53.012" style="s2">little monster. We saw what you did and</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.712" end="00:30:55.412" style="s2">you&#39;re still lying?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.012" end="00:30:57.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew he was lying again. Nobody opens</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.412" end="00:30:59.012" style="s2">that door. Let him stay out there and</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.212" end="00:31:01.112" style="s2">think about what he&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.012" end="00:31:04.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this is what it feels like</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.112" end="00:31:06.712" style="s2">to actually be loved by your family?</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.012" end="00:31:10.712" style="s2">Guess this really was meant to happen.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.712" end="00:31:10.712" style="s2">Hell, we even look almost exactly alike.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.512" end="00:31:18.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. Mom&#39;s right here. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.412" end="00:31:18.212" style="s2">going anywhere. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.912" end="00:31:23.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, quit nagging and send me the damn</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.812" end="00:31:25.712" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.312" end="00:31:27.612" style="s2">The old lady coughed up the cash.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.712" end="00:31:29.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, you threw away the one thing I</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.612" end="00:31:32.512" style="s2">begged for until I died, a family that</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.812" end="00:31:35.212" style="s2">loved you. From now on, I&#39;ll live as Kai</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.512" end="00:31:35.212" style="s2">and do it right.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.012" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, come on. Have some soup.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.212" end="00:31:49.812" style="s2">Easy. It&#39;s still hot.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.112" end="00:32:08.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, look who it is. Mr. Colin</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.912" end="00:32:09.912" style="s2">Prescott. What are you doing in the</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.712" end="00:32:11.912" style="s2">kitchen this late?</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.912" end="00:32:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rosa, I I&#39;m just really hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.912" end="00:32:14.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hungry? Didn&#39;t I already send your</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.712" end="00:32:16.512" style="s2">dinner up?</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.912" end="00:32:18.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It It was spoiled.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.512" end="00:32:20.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Prescott made herself perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:22.812" style="s2">clear. Everything in this kitchen is for</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.112" end="00:32:22.812" style="s2">Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.812" end="00:32:28.112" style="s2">Eat it or starve.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.812" end="00:32:31.112" style="s2">You grew up in foster care and now you</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:31.112" style="s2">think you&#39;re some rich kid?</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.912" end="00:32:39.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks,</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.313" end="00:32:45.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never have to thank me. I&#39;m your</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.713" end="00:32:47.213" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.313" end="00:32:49.313" style="s2">For three years, all I wanted was to</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.213" end="00:32:53.113" style="s2">cook for you again, see you open your</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.313" end="00:32:53.113" style="s2">eyes, hear you call me mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.013" end="00:33:05.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with all the tears? Come on, pull</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.013" end="00:33:05.813" style="s2">yourself together.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.213" end="00:33:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For three years, all I wanted was to</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.113" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">cook for you again, see you open your</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.113" end="00:33:16.013" style="s2">eyes, hear you call me mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.513" end="00:33:22.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, enough crying. If Wall Street</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.313" end="00:33:26.613" style="s2">hears the Barrett air is falling apart</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.713" end="00:33:26.613" style="s2">in bed, our stock will tank by morning.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">The doctors say you&#39;re recovering well.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.913" end="00:33:33.013" style="s2">How do you feel?</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:34.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better. A lot better, dad. I&#39;m still</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.013" end="00:33:35.413" style="s2">getting used to everything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.013" end="00:33:36.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last three years are over. We don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.413" end="00:33:38.313" style="s2">talk about them again.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.768" end="00:33:41.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.313" end="00:33:41.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Little bastard.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.713" end="00:33:49.213" style="s2">The black card yours, no limit.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.313" end="00:33:51.613" style="s2">And that new Aston Martin downstairs,</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.213" end="00:33:51.613" style="s2">yours too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.913" end="00:34:00.413" style="s2">No more street races. You land yourself</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.813" end="00:34:00.413" style="s2">in the ICU again, you&#39;re on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.713" end="00:34:06.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roland, what the hell is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.013" end="00:34:08.113" style="s2">Our son just woke up after three years</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.913" end="00:34:10.613" style="s2">and you&#39;re already on his ass? If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.113" end="00:34:14.613" style="s2">here TO PRESSURE HIM, GET OUT!</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.613" end="00:34:14.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CAROL, I&#39;M TRYING TO set some rules.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.113" end="00:34:24.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, thank you. But</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.413" end="00:34:24.613" style="s2">I don&#39;t need any of this right now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.913" end="00:34:31.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.813" end="00:34:32.613" style="s2">Something&#39;s wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.113" end="00:34:34.313" style="s2">The old Kai would have crawled over here</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.613" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">on two broken legs for that card and</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.313" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">those keys.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.213" end="00:34:41.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not Kai.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.913" end="00:34:41.814" style="s2">Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.714" end="00:34:46.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roland,</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.814" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">what the hell are you talking about? Of</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.114" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">course he&#39;s our son.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.614" end="00:34:56.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know he&#39;s our son.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:57.514" style="s2">He just doesn&#39;t feel like the Kai I</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.214" end="00:34:58.914" style="s2">knew.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.514" end="00:35:00.814" style="s2">That little bastard only cared about</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.914" end="00:35:03.114" style="s2">fast cars, parties, and burning through</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.814" end="00:35:05.314" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.114" end="00:35:07.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nearly dying changes you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.314" end="00:35:09.914" style="s2">Maybe he finally grew up.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.914" end="00:35:11.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost died in that crash.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.914" end="00:35:13.114" style="s2">Waking up made me realize how much I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.414" end="00:35:15.014" style="s2">been throwing away.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.114" end="00:35:16.714" style="s2">Dad, I screwed up before, but I want to</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.014" end="00:35:20.014" style="s2">get better and start over.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.714" end="00:35:20.014" style="s2">I promise I won&#39;t let you down again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.259" end="00:35:22.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.014" end="00:35:27.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.414" end="00:35:27.214" style="s2">That&#39;s more like it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.514" end="00:35:31.914" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.914" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">That&#39;s more like it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.914" end="00:35:34.414" style="s2">We&#39;ll throw a party and announce you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.114" end="00:35:35.914" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.414" end="00:35:38.914" style="s2">Time to shut up everyone waiting for the</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:38.914" style="s2">Barretts to fall apart.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:42.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.514" end="00:36:03.814" style="s2">God gave me a second life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.814" end="00:36:05.614" style="s2">First, I&#39;ll become the man Kai Barrett</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.814" end="00:36:07.014" style="s2">should have been.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.614" end="00:36:08.414" style="s2">Then,</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.014" end="00:36:11.514" style="s2">I&#39;ll make the Prescotts pay for</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.414" end="00:36:11.514" style="s2">everything they did.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.660" end="00:36:14.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.314" end="00:36:20.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.514" end="00:36:22.014" style="s2">the Barretts are old money. Their pocket</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.414" end="00:36:24.414" style="s2">change could fund this family for a</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.014" end="00:36:26.414" style="s2">decade.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.414" end="00:36:28.614" style="s2">Get close to Kai Barrett. I don&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.414" end="00:36:31.014" style="s2">how.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.614" end="00:36:33.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, Dad. With my talent and charm,</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.014" end="00:36:36.514" style="s2">getting Kai to like me should be easy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.314" end="00:36:38.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like you? That&#39;s not enough.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.514" end="00:36:39.314" style="s2">If your sister marries him, we&#39;re set</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.314" end="00:36:42.214" style="s2">for life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.314" end="00:36:44.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you want me to marry Kai?</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.214" end="00:36:45.916" style="s2">Everyone in Philly knows he&#39;s a spoiled</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.114" end="00:36:47.916" style="s2">playboy. The only thing he ever did</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.916" end="00:36:49.116" style="s2">right was get born rich.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.916" end="00:36:50.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.116" end="00:36:52.016" style="s2">You don&#39;t know [ __ ] You should be</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.516" end="00:36:53.316" style="s2">grateful you can do something for this</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.016" end="00:36:54.816" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.316" end="00:36:57.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard the Barrett heir was in a coma</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.816" end="00:36:58.316" style="s2">for three years. He only woke up a few</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.116" end="00:37:00.316" style="s2">months ago.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.316" end="00:37:02.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett&#39;s over the moon. I bet</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.316" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">tonight&#39;s party is to officially name</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.016" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">Kai as his heir.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.616" end="00:37:10.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen, please welcome the</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.016" end="00:37:13.616" style="s2">sole heir to the Barrett group, Mr. Kai</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.816" end="00:37:13.616" style="s2">Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.850" end="00:37:18.870" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.416" end="00:37:34.816" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen, Mr. Barrett will</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.116" end="00:37:36.416" style="s2">be joining us shortly. Thank you for</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.816" end="00:37:37.716" style="s2">your patience.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.416" end="00:37:41.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think tonight&#39;s party is to</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.716" end="00:37:43.216" style="s2">officially name Kai the Barrett heir?</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.516" end="00:37:44.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t bet on it. Everyone remembers</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.216" end="00:37:46.316" style="s2">what Kai was like.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.716" end="00:37:48.116" style="s2">Audrey runs the Barrett&#39;s overseas</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.316" end="00:37:50.416" style="s2">business now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.116" end="00:37:53.216" style="s2">She&#39;s the one really calling the shots.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.416" end="00:37:54.416" style="s2">Blood&#39;s blood. An empire this big,</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.216" end="00:37:56.716" style="s2">Roland&#39;s still going to hand it to his</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.416" end="00:37:59.216" style="s2">own son in the end.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.716" end="00:38:00.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry to interrupt, but</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.216" end="00:38:02.116" style="s2">who&#39;s Audrey?</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.416" end="00:38:05.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t even know Audrey?</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.116" end="00:38:05.416" style="s2">How the hell did you get invited here?</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.816" end="00:38:11.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m new to the circle.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.016" end="00:38:13.216" style="s2">Still learning from everyone here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.416" end="00:38:16.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roland&#39;s adopted daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.216" end="00:38:16.016" style="s2">She&#39;s a shark.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.516" end="00:38:19.316" style="s2">Hell, she&#39;s practically been carrying</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.816" end="00:38:21.716" style="s2">the overseas business by herself for</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.316" end="00:38:21.716" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.616" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.316" end="00:38:46.516" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.516" end="00:38:48.317" style="s2">we&#39;re celebrating a miracle.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.516" end="00:38:52.017" style="s2">My son, Kai,</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.317" end="00:38:52.017" style="s2">is finally back on his feet.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.917" end="00:38:56.417" style="s2">I hope you&#39;ll all give him your support.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.917" end="00:39:03.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you mom, dad,</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.817" end="00:39:03.817" style="s2">and everyone for coming.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:11.617" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a lot to catch up on,</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.417" end="00:39:14.817" style="s2">but from today on,</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.617" end="00:39:14.817" style="s2">I&#39;m ready to pull my weight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.017" end="00:39:25.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.317" end="00:39:30.117" style="s2">Why does he look exactly like Colin?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.472" end="00:39:34.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.117" end="00:39:37.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get a grip, Damian. That loser Colin&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.117" end="00:39:38.417" style="s2">been rotting at the bottom of the river.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.217" end="00:39:39.717" style="s2">Besides,</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.417" end="00:39:41.517" style="s2">this guy&#39;s got more presence in his</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.717" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">pinky than that broke ass nobody ever</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.517" end="00:39:43.917" style="s2">had.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.817" end="00:39:49.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That face looks weirdly familiar. Kind</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.817" end="00:39:51.417" style="s2">of makes me sick. Nice suit though.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.017" end="00:39:54.717" style="s2">Shame he&#39;s such a screw up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.417" end="00:39:54.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow! What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.017" end="00:39:59.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Women all over Philly would kill for</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.617" end="00:39:59.217" style="s2">that ring.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.417" end="00:40:07.517" style="s2">Him being useless</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.117" end="00:40:07.517" style="s2">makes him easier to control.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.117" end="00:40:14.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you. You&#39;re looking great. You</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:15.317" style="s2">cheated death once. Now you&#39;ve got a</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.417" end="00:40:16.817" style="s2">whole life ahead of you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.317" end="00:40:17.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Richard. I&#39;m just grateful to be</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.817" end="00:40:19.117" style="s2">standing here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.517" end="00:40:22.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re just glad you&#39;re awake. Come visit</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.117" end="00:40:22.017" style="s2">the estate sometime.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.617" end="00:40:29.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely, Uncle Tom.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.617" end="00:40:31.817" style="s2">I&#39;ll definitely have a lot to learn from</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.917" end="00:40:33.517" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.817" end="00:40:35.217" style="s2">Excuse me. I&#39;m going to step over there</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.517" end="00:40:37.017" style="s2">for some air. Enjoy the party.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.217" end="00:40:38.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.017" end="00:40:42.017" style="s2">You&#39;re the man of the hour tonight. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.917" end="00:40:42.017" style="s2">sure you&#39;re exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.117" end="00:40:51.618" style="s2">Go. This is your chance.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.968" end="00:40:56.988" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.918" end="00:41:04.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett, congratulations on your</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.918" end="00:41:06.518" style="s2">recovery.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.918" end="00:41:08.318" style="s2">Great speech.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.518" end="00:41:10.818" style="s2">I&#39;m Damian Prescott. I&#39;ve heard a lot</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.318" end="00:41:10.818" style="s2">about you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.518" end="00:41:17.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Prescotts.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.418" end="00:41:20.018" style="s2">How the hell did a nobody family like</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.118" end="00:41:20.018" style="s2">them get invited?</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.318" end="00:41:27.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Prescotts? Yeah. I&#39;ve heard the</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.718" end="00:41:29.418" style="s2">name.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.918" end="00:41:30.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m honored you&#39;ve heard of us, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.418" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.518" end="00:41:34.718" style="s2">We&#39;ve made some progress in tech, but</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.418" end="00:41:36.318" style="s2">we&#39;re nowhere near the Barretts.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.718" end="00:41:37.818" style="s2">I just got lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.318" end="00:41:39.818" style="s2">Designed a few rocket propulsion</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.818" end="00:41:42.318" style="s2">systems, and somehow they picked up a</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.818" end="00:41:43.718" style="s2">few international aerospace awards.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.318" end="00:41:44.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aerospace?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.718" end="00:41:46.818" style="s2">Funny.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.718" end="00:41:48.418" style="s2">You studied finance, Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.818" end="00:41:50.618" style="s2">Really?</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.418" end="00:41:51.818" style="s2">So you&#39;re some kind of genius.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:54.718" style="s2">What did you design?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.818" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The biggest one is Mercury II. It just</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.718" end="00:41:58.818" style="s2">won the Astra Award, the top prize at</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:42:00.518" style="s2">the International Aerospace Innovation</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.818" end="00:42:01.818" style="s2">Awards, and I&#39;ve got a few other</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.518" end="00:42:04.418" style="s2">designs, too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.818" end="00:42:06.018" style="s2">Here, Mr. Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.418" end="00:42:08.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] fraud.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.018" end="00:42:09.618" style="s2">You stole my family,</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.118" end="00:42:10.918" style="s2">and now you&#39;re stealing my life&#39;s work,</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.618" end="00:42:13.018" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.918" end="00:42:16.018" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.018" end="00:42:18.018" style="s2">I&#39;ll make every Prescott pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.018" end="00:42:19.918" style="s2">An Astra Award at your age?</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.018" end="00:42:20.818" style="s2">Impressive. You must be pretty damn</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.918" end="00:42:22.818" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.818" end="00:42:24.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too kind, Mr. Barrett. Honestly,</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.818" end="00:42:25.718" style="s2">I just got lucky. Right place, right</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.618" end="00:42:26.918" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.718" end="00:42:28.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.918" end="00:42:29.918" style="s2">I heard your so-called master picks is</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.618" end="00:42:32.918" style="s2">look a hell of a lot like some old</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.918" end="00:42:32.918" style="s2">discarded drafts.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.618" end="00:42:37.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Mr. Barrett, no.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.918" end="00:42:38.318" style="s2">That&#39;s impossible. It has to be a</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.118" end="00:42:39.318" style="s2">coincidence. People come up with similar</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.318" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">ideas all the time.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.318" end="00:42:43.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A coincidence? Sure, but a copy is still</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.518" end="00:42:45.118" style="s2">a soulless knockoff. Remember that?</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.618" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Mr. Barrett. You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.118" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure my next project is more</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">original. I still have a lot to learn.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.518" end="00:42:55.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is your problem, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.420" end="00:42:57.120" style="s2">Barrett? My brother pulled all nights</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.420" end="00:42:58.920" style="s2">designing those engines. Our whole</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.120" end="00:42:59.920" style="s2">family watched him bust his ass for</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.920" end="00:43:01.320" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.920" end="00:43:03.020" style="s2">The only reason you&#39;re standing here is</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.320" end="00:43:05.720" style="s2">because you were born a Barrett. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.020" end="00:43:07.320" style="s2">a spoiled, useless playboy. Who the hell</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.720" end="00:43:09.720" style="s2">are you to spit all over my brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.320" end="00:43:09.720" style="s2">work?</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.020" end="00:43:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina,</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.220" end="00:43:14.920" style="s2">are you [ __ ] insane?</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.320" end="00:43:16.120" style="s2">How dare you talk to Mr. Barrett like</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.920" end="00:43:18.220" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.120" end="00:43:20.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett, I&#39;m so sorry. Please</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.220" end="00:43:21.720" style="s2">forgive her. She&#39;s crazy when it comes</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.020" end="00:43:25.520" style="s2">to her brother. Please don&#39;t waste your</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.720" end="00:43:25.520" style="s2">time on a stupid girl like her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.120" end="00:43:29.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.420" end="00:43:31.420" style="s2">What a devoted sister.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.320" end="00:43:33.420" style="s2">You never once had my back, Tina, but</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.420" end="00:43:36.520" style="s2">for this [ __ ] parasite,</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.420" end="00:43:36.520" style="s2">now you want to play hero?</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.755" end="00:43:38.775" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.420" end="00:43:46.320" style="s2">Easy, Tina. It was just a question.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.270" end="00:43:50.020" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.320" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">Because real stays real</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.020" end="00:43:54.220" style="s2">and fake stays fake,</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.920" end="00:43:54.220" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.620" end="00:44:00.720" style="s2">Some things you&#39;re born with.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.720" end="00:44:02.720" style="s2">Blood,</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.720" end="00:44:04.220" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.720" end="00:44:05.620" style="s2">But titles,</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.220" end="00:44:07.320" style="s2">status,</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.620" end="00:44:08.720" style="s2">so-called talent,</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.320" end="00:44:10.120" style="s2">you can steal it and cling to it all you</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.720" end="00:44:11.520" style="s2">want,</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.120" end="00:44:12.920" style="s2">but you still lie awake every night</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.520" end="00:44:14.020" style="s2">wondering when someone&#39;s coming to take</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.920" end="00:44:16.920" style="s2">it back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.020" end="00:44:19.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut the [ __ ] up!</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.920" end="00:44:21.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina, are you insane? Mr. Barrett, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.820" end="00:44:22.720" style="s2">sorry. She doesn&#39;t know what she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.020" end="00:44:24.920" style="s2">saying. Please don&#39;t hold this against</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.720" end="00:44:24.920" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.520" end="00:44:34.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] IDIOT. GET ON YOUR KNEES AND</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.820" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">APOLOGIZE TO MR. BARRETT.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.520" end="00:44:38.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. BARRETT, this is on me. I raised her</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:40.520" style="s2">wrong. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.820" end="00:44:42.020" style="s2">we&#39;re nobodies. Don&#39;t waste your time on</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.520" end="00:44:43.220" style="s2">people like us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.020" end="00:44:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with the Prescotts</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.220" end="00:44:47.120" style="s2">screaming their heads off at a party</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.320" end="00:44:49.620" style="s2">like this? So trashy. New money, no</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.120" end="00:44:49.620" style="s2">class.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.521" end="00:45:05.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Prescott,</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.321" end="00:45:07.121" style="s2">your family seems a little unstable</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.321" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">tonight. Maybe you should take them home</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.121" end="00:45:12.321" style="s2">and get them some help.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:12.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.621" end="00:45:16.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That already broke you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.621" end="00:45:17.721" style="s2">Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.121" end="00:45:21.021" style="s2">Tina,</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.721" end="00:45:21.021" style="s2">we haven&#39;t even started yet.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.106" end="00:45:30.126" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.421" end="00:45:45.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, what are you doing out here?</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.321" end="00:45:46.921" style="s2">Tired?</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.221" end="00:45:48.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.921" end="00:45:50.821" style="s2">Just ran into the Prescotts.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.921" end="00:45:52.421" style="s2">Put those flies in their place.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.821" end="00:45:53.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Prescotts?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.421" end="00:45:56.021" style="s2">They only bought their way into this</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.721" end="00:45:58.821" style="s2">circle two years ago. Stay away from</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.021" end="00:46:00.521" style="s2">them. I&#39;ve heard their money&#39;s dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.821" end="00:46:02.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.521" end="00:46:03.221" style="s2">But watching clowns lose their [ __ ] once</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.021" end="00:46:06.021" style="s2">in a while,</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.221" end="00:46:06.021" style="s2">kind of relaxing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.421" end="00:46:20.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat more, Kai. You&#39;re way too thin.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.321" end="00:46:27.112" style="s2">Here, more bacon. You need the protein.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.092" end="00:46:27.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.821" end="00:46:33.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.952" end="00:46:35.021" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.721" end="00:46:38.021" style="s2">dad, the board&#39;s reconsidering who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.021" end="00:46:38.021" style="s2">going to take over the company.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.721" end="00:46:50.921" style="s2">Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.621" end="00:46:53.921" style="s2">dad, the board&#39;s reconsidering who</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.921" end="00:46:53.921" style="s2">should take over the company.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.121" end="00:46:57.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, you said the board has a problem</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.721" end="00:46:59.223" style="s2">with Kyle taking over?</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.422" end="00:47:00.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few long time board members think Kyle</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.223" end="00:47:02.023" style="s2">just woke up and doesn&#39;t know the</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.422" end="00:47:05.823" style="s2">business yet.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.023" end="00:47:05.823" style="s2">They want me to stay on as acting CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.632" end="00:47:11.652" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.723" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">Out partying again?</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.223" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">Dad&#39;s heart is bad enough already. Can</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:25.422" style="s2">you stop putting him through this [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.523" end="00:47:27.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Putting him through what?</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.422" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">He&#39;s got you, his perfect daughter. You</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.622" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">run the company, this whole damn family.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.723" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">I&#39;m just the [ __ ] spare.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.622" end="00:47:39.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai,</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.422" end="00:47:39.023" style="s2">you&#39;re hopeless.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.823" end="00:47:44.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She still remembers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.622" end="00:47:44.823" style="s2">This was my favorite as a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.523" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">She still remembers.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.323" end="00:47:51.422" style="s2">This was my favorite as a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.823" end="00:48:01.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.723" end="00:48:03.223" style="s2">your sister&#39;s just not great at showing</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.823" end="00:48:07.122" style="s2">how she feels.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.223" end="00:48:07.122" style="s2">She cares about you a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.023" end="00:48:18.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water, please.</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.622" end="00:48:36.023" style="s2">Water.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.403" end="00:48:41.388" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.368" end="00:48:41.388" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.122" end="00:48:45.422" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:46.823" style="s2">I have a family now,</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:50.223" style="s2">a warm bed.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.823" end="00:48:50.223" style="s2">I&#39;m not that basement rat anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.433" end="00:48:57.108" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.088" end="00:48:57.108" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.523" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad dream?</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.224" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.224" end="00:49:11.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drink this.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.624" end="00:49:11.324" style="s2">It&#39;ll help you sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.124" end="00:49:41.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is going on? Can we get</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.024" end="00:49:43.924" style="s2">through one meal without you causing</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.524" end="00:49:45.824" style="s2">trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.924" end="00:49:48.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Dad. The bowl was too hot. I</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.824" end="00:49:48.724" style="s2">couldn&#39;t hold on to it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.324" end="00:49:54.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.624" end="00:49:57.324" style="s2">let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.924" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">Did you burn yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.324" end="00:50:00.324" style="s2">What are you standing there for? Go get</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">an ice pack.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:04.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, my arm.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.724" end="00:50:06.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a little burn. Stop making</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.424" end="00:50:08.624" style="s2">such a scene. Look how badly you scared</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.124" end="00:50:08.624" style="s2">Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:24.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Audrey.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.724" end="00:50:24.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not too hot. I checked.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.024" end="00:50:33.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never knew milk could taste this</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.124" end="00:50:33.524" style="s2">sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.124" end="00:50:40.124" style="s2">Dad, I want to work at the company.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.124" end="00:50:44.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.324" end="00:50:45.924" style="s2">What changed? You used to run for the</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.024" end="00:50:47.324" style="s2">hills anytime I brought up the company.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.924" end="00:50:48.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those three years in that bed felt like</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.324" end="00:50:50.024" style="s2">one long nightmare.</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.724" end="00:50:51.724" style="s2">When I woke up, I realized I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.024" end="00:50:52.924" style="s2">keep throwing my life away.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.724" end="00:50:55.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.924" end="00:50:57.424" style="s2">It&#39;s about time you figured that out.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.024" end="00:50:58.924" style="s2">But Barrett Group is complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.424" end="00:51:01.124" style="s2">You just woke up and you barely know the</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.924" end="00:51:02.325" style="s2">business, and</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.124" end="00:51:05.225" style="s2">the board&#39;s very happy with the way your</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.325" end="00:51:05.225" style="s2">sister&#39;s running things.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.725" end="00:51:08.925" style="s2">The board&#39;s very happy with the way your</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.025" end="00:51:09.925" style="s2">sister&#39;s running things.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.925" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">I get it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.925" end="00:51:13.825" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking for some fancy title.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.325" end="00:51:14.925" style="s2">Start me at the bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.825" end="00:51:16.570" style="s2">I want to learn from Aubrey and take</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.925" end="00:51:17.425" style="s2">some of the pressure off.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.570" end="00:51:18.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.425" end="00:51:20.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s what I want to hear from a</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.725" end="00:51:22.325" style="s2">Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.125" end="00:51:23.725" style="s2">Report to the project division tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.325" end="00:51:26.525" style="s2">You&#39;ll start as a project manager and</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.725" end="00:51:28.325" style="s2">learn the business from the ground up.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.525" end="00:51:30.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.325" end="00:51:30.925" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you down.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.425" end="00:51:38.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett, these are all the major</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.725" end="00:51:40.425" style="s2">project files from the past three years.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.525" end="00:51:41.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. Leave them on the desk and I</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.425" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">need you to look into something for me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.825" end="00:51:44.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. What am I looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.325" end="00:51:46.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull every project that&#39;s ever crossed</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.825" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">hands with Prescott Tech. Bids,</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:49.825" style="s2">contracts, anything. If we bought so</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.525" end="00:51:50.425" style="s2">much as a screw from them, I want it on</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.825" end="00:51:52.825" style="s2">my desk.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.425" end="00:51:54.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. I&#39;ll get on it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.825" end="00:51:57.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this is stays in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.725" end="00:52:00.425" style="s2">Nobody knows but you and me. Understood?</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.625" end="00:52:00.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.825" end="00:52:04.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy the spotlight you stole, Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.825" end="00:52:07.525" style="s2">Soon you&#39;ll find out how much it hurts</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.425" end="00:52:07.525" style="s2">when I knock you off the top.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.825" end="00:52:20.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You useless piece of [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.025" end="00:52:23.925" style="s2">That Barrett party was our chance to get</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.825" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">in with the biggest names in the city.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.925" end="00:52:29.125" style="s2">And instead of making connections, you</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:31.325" style="s2">pissed off Kai. [ __ ] Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.125" end="00:52:32.225" style="s2">Now the whole social circle is laughing</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.325" end="00:52:34.525" style="s2">at us.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.225" end="00:52:37.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, didn&#39;t you see it?</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.525" end="00:52:37.725" style="s2">Kai was coming after me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.225" end="00:52:42.925" style="s2">He was [ __ ] with me on purpose. The</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.325" end="00:52:44.525" style="s2">way he looked at me,</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.925" end="00:52:47.125" style="s2">he knows something. He knows those</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.525" end="00:52:47.125" style="s2">designs were</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.325" end="00:53:05.127" style="s2">The way he looked at me,</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.025" end="00:53:06.527" style="s2">he knows something.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.127" end="00:53:09.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knows what?</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.527" end="00:53:09.327" style="s2">Who the [ __ ] is he?</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.627" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t give a [ __ ] if Barrett Group is</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.227" end="00:53:16.327" style="s2">the best tech company in the country.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.527" end="00:53:18.327" style="s2">Kai&#39;s a spoiled rich brat who spent</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.327" end="00:53:20.427" style="s2">three years hooked up to machines. What</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.327" end="00:53:23.027" style="s2">the [ __ ] does he know about tech? About</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.427" end="00:53:25.427" style="s2">rockets?</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.027" end="00:53:27.227" style="s2">Wipe that [ __ ] look off your face.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.427" end="00:53:30.427" style="s2">Your only job is to land the NASA</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.227" end="00:53:31.927" style="s2">Commercial Space Project. Got it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.427" end="00:53:33.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.927" end="00:53:34.827" style="s2">My team is getting that project if it</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.427" end="00:53:38.227" style="s2">kills us.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.827" end="00:53:38.227" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s standing in our way.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.527" end="00:53:50.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.827" end="00:53:52.327" style="s2">Look into the National Youth Aerospace</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.527" end="00:53:54.227" style="s2">Innovation Competition from four years</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.327" end="00:53:56.527" style="s2">ago. I want the original manuscript that</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.227" end="00:53:58.027" style="s2">won first place. Find every judge and</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.527" end="00:53:59.227" style="s2">teacher who knew anything about it. Dig</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.027" end="00:54:00.527" style="s2">as deep as you have to.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.227" end="00:54:02.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, Mr. Barrett.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.527" end="00:54:04.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more thing. Trace the Prescotts&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.527" end="00:54:05.727" style="s2">cash flow for the last three months.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.527" end="00:54:07.627" style="s2">Find out how much they&#39;ve bet on the</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.727" end="00:54:09.927" style="s2">NASA Commercial Space Project. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.627" end="00:54:12.327" style="s2">know how close they are to bleeding dry.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.927" end="00:54:12.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.972" end="00:54:21.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.027" end="00:54:42.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, you look wiped out. Are they</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.227" end="00:54:43.427" style="s2">dumping all the work on you already?</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.127" end="00:54:45.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, Mom. I just took on a new</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.427" end="00:54:46.727" style="s2">project. It&#39;s a little intense, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.327" end="00:54:48.127" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.727" end="00:54:49.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little pressure is good. Means you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.127" end="00:54:51.227" style="s2">actually invested. Those old sharks</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.927" end="00:54:52.927" style="s2">giving you a hard time?</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.227" end="00:54:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Dad. Everyone&#39;s been working with</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.927" end="00:54:55.527" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.427" end="00:54:57.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work can wait. You just woke up from a</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.527" end="00:54:59.127" style="s2">three-year coma, Kai. You&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.127" end="00:55:00.527" style="s2">recovering. Tomorrow I&#39;ll have the</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.127" end="00:55:03.027" style="s2">kitchen make you something nourishing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.527" end="00:55:06.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom. You win.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.027" end="00:55:06.327" style="s2">I&#39;m going to shower and get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.728" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett, I found the head judge from</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.328" end="00:55:20.428" style="s2">that competition. He&#39;s retired now, but</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.028" end="00:55:21.728" style="s2">he&#39;s willing to testify. More</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.428" end="00:55:23.628" style="s2">importantly, he kept a copy of the</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.728" end="00:55:25.028" style="s2">original Mars 1 submission, and the name</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.628" end="00:55:26.128" style="s2">on it is right there in black and white,</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.028" end="00:55:27.528" style="s2">Colin Prescott.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.128" end="00:55:28.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it enough to prove Damian stole the</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.528" end="00:55:29.528" style="s2">design?</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.228" end="00:55:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More than enough. I already sent the</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.528" end="00:55:33.428" style="s2">comparison report to your email. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:34.828" style="s2">separation system, propulsion layout,</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.428" end="00:55:36.608" style="s2">all the core engineering matches</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.828" end="00:55:39.128" style="s2">Damian&#39;s Astra award-winning Mercury</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.608" end="00:55:40.828" style="s2">[music] 2, 99 %.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.128" end="00:55:42.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the dates don&#39;t lie. Mars 1 was</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.828" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">submitted a full 4 years before Damian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.728" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">design.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.228" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mars 1 was submitted a full 4 years</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.928" end="00:55:51.128" style="s2">before Damian&#39;s design.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.628" end="00:55:54.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.928" end="00:55:55.728" style="s2">What about the media?</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.228" end="00:55:58.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The major outlets have the story ready</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.728" end="00:55:59.828" style="s2">to go. One click and it hits everywhere,</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.128" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">just like you asked. The anonymous</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.828" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">evidence packet is already with the</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.328" end="00:56:05.328" style="s2">Engineering Association&#39;s Disciplinary</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:07.328" style="s2">Committee. Original drafts, comparison</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.328" end="00:56:08.828" style="s2">charts, everything.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.328" end="00:56:11.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice work.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.828" end="00:56:11.528" style="s2">Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.428" end="00:56:17.228" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.328" end="00:56:19.728" style="s2">I&#39;m taking back everything that belonged</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.228" end="00:56:19.728" style="s2">to Colin.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.828" end="00:56:29.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, an anonymous package just came in.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.728" end="00:56:31.428" style="s2">Original competition records from 4</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.228" end="00:56:34.428" style="s2">years ago, the Mars 1 blueprints, and</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.428" end="00:56:34.428" style="s2">proof of when it was submitted.</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.904" end="00:56:38.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.328" end="00:56:39.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same core design,</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.028" end="00:56:41.728" style="s2">same specs.</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.528" end="00:56:43.528" style="s2">Even the revision marks [ __ ] match.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.728" end="00:56:44.928" style="s2">This is [ __ ] Damian Prescott&#39;s, the</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.528" end="00:56:46.328" style="s2">Astra Award.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.928" end="00:56:47.428" style="s2">Wait, if he won it with stolen work,</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.328" end="00:56:51.228" style="s2">this doesn&#39;t just destroy his</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.428" end="00:56:51.228" style="s2">reputation, it destroys ours, too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.228" end="00:56:57.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s already blowing up, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.028" end="00:56:58.628" style="s2">Twitter&#39;s on fire and everyone&#39;s tearing</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.528" end="00:57:02.028" style="s2">us apart.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.628" end="00:57:02.028" style="s2">Do we put out an emergency statement?</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.528" end="00:57:07.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Issue a statement.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.128" end="00:57:09.228" style="s2">Send legal notices to Prescott Group and</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:11.929" style="s2">Damian demanding an explanation, then</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.228" end="00:57:14.429" style="s2">suspend every award and title we&#39;ve ever</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.929" end="00:57:14.429" style="s2">given him.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.129" end="00:57:20.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breaking news. Prescott Group Vice</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.029" end="00:57:23.329" style="s2">President Damian Prescott is under</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.829" end="00:57:25.729" style="s2">investigation for plagiarism. His Astra</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.329" end="00:57:28.229" style="s2">award-winning Mercury II allegedly bears</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.729" end="00:57:30.029" style="s2">a near identical resemblance to Mars I,</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.229" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">a design submitted years earlier by his</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.029" end="00:57:34.429" style="s2">brother, Colin Prescott. The Engineering</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.229" end="00:57:37.529" style="s2">Association has suspended Damian&#39;s award</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.429" end="00:57:37.529" style="s2">pending the investigation.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.329" end="00:57:46.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.129" end="00:57:46.629" style="s2">is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.529" end="00:57:58.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Swear you had this handled.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.729" end="00:58:00.729" style="s2">Genius engineer my ass. Plagiarism?</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.429" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">What the [ __ ] were you thinking?</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.729" end="00:58:05.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, it&#39;s all [ __ ] Somebody&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.229" end="00:58:07.829" style="s2">trying to destroy the Prescotts.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.529" end="00:58:08.429" style="s2">It&#39;s Kai. That useless bastard has to be</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.829" end="00:58:10.529" style="s2">behind this.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.429" end="00:58:11.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai&#39;s just jealous. He paid people off</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.529" end="00:58:14.329" style="s2">to smear Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still don&#39;t get how bad this is.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.329" end="00:58:17.729" style="s2">This goddamn scandal. The banks are</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.029" end="00:58:18.829" style="s2">already calling in our loans.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.729" end="00:58:20.529" style="s2">Shareholders have been blowing up my</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.829" end="00:58:22.329" style="s2">phone all morning. Our stock is in</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.529" end="00:58:23.729" style="s2">freefall. I don&#39;t give a [ __ ] whose</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.329" end="00:58:25.529" style="s2">designs they were.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.729" end="00:58:28.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Naxa project is the only thing keeping</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.529" end="00:58:30.129" style="s2">this family alive. You win that bid no</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.229" end="00:58:31.629" style="s2">matter what it takes. Do you understand</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.129" end="00:58:33.529" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.629" end="00:58:35.529" style="s2">Screw this up again and we don&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.529" end="00:58:37.229" style="s2">lose the company. We&#39;ll be buried in</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.529" end="00:58:38.829" style="s2">debt for the rest of our lives. This</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.229" end="00:58:41.829" style="s2">whole family will end up out on the</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.829" end="00:58:41.829" style="s2">[ __ ] street.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.029" end="00:59:07.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, this is my R&amp;D plan for the Naxa</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.429" end="00:59:10.329" style="s2">Commercial Space Project along with the</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.129" end="00:59:10.329" style="s2">core design schematics.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.729" end="00:59:15.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company has a formal review process.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.931" end="00:59:18.331" style="s2">You should have submitted this to the</p>
<p begin="00:59:15.031" end="00:59:18.331" style="s2">technical division first.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.431" end="00:59:20.831" style="s2">You should have submitted it to the</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.431" end="00:59:22.031" style="s2">technical division through the proper</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.831" end="00:59:23.231" style="s2">channels.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.031" end="00:59:24.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.231" end="00:59:27.631" style="s2">I just wanted you to look it over first</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.631" end="00:59:27.631" style="s2">and tell me what you think.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.231" end="00:59:31.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really drew these? I remember</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.931" end="00:59:32.231" style="s2">engineering diagrams giving you a</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.331" end="00:59:34.131" style="s2">headache.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.231" end="00:59:36.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, yeah, I used to be a mess.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.131" end="00:59:37.631" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t mean I learned nothing at MIT.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.131" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">While I was recovering, I got back into</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.631" end="00:59:40.931" style="s2">aerospace engineering and went through</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:43.131" style="s2">years of company research and prototype</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.931" end="00:59:44.931" style="s2">test data. I rebuilt this proposal from</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.131" end="00:59:47.031" style="s2">Barrett&#39;s existing research. Every</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.931" end="00:59:49.431" style="s2">number, every component, I can explain</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.031" end="00:59:49.431" style="s2">all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:53.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, at Barrett Group, results and data</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.831" end="00:59:54.631" style="s2">are all that matter. You don&#39;t get a</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.431" end="00:59:56.831" style="s2">free pass just because you&#39;re my</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.631" end="00:59:59.331" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.831" end="00:59:59.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want one.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.531" end="01:00:03.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Submit it to the technical division. If</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.331" end="01:00:04.531" style="s2">it passes review, you&#39;ll lead Barrett</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.031" end="01:00:06.031" style="s2">Group&#39;s bid for the Naxa commercial</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.531" end="01:00:07.931" style="s2">space project.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.031" end="01:00:10.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Audrey.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.931" end="01:00:10.631" style="s2">I&#39;ll prove I earned it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.631" end="01:00:16.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me every document submitted for</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.031" end="01:00:16.731" style="s2">this project.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.931" end="01:00:23.131" style="s2">Kai,</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.231" end="01:00:23.131" style="s2">you really did grow up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.031" end="01:00:28.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We call it Explorer.</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.931" end="01:00:30.531" style="s2">It uses lightweight, high-strength</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.531" end="01:00:32.431" style="s2">aerospace composites to reduce overall</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.531" end="01:00:34.831" style="s2">mass without compromising structural</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.431" end="01:00:37.431" style="s2">integrity. Less weight means lower fuel</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.831" end="01:00:39.331" style="s2">consumption and more payload capacity.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.431" end="01:00:40.231" style="s2">We also redesigned the stage separation</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.331" end="01:00:42.031" style="s2">system.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.231" end="01:00:43.731" style="s2">Even under difficult flight conditions,</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.031" end="01:00:45.431" style="s2">separation stays stable, which</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.731" end="01:00:46.331" style="s2">significantly lowers the risk of losing</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.431" end="01:00:48.131" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.331" end="01:00:49.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The numbers look impressive,</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.131" end="01:00:51.331" style="s2">but lightweight materials and modular</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.631" end="01:00:53.131" style="s2">construction can make manufacturing more</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.331" end="01:00:55.597" style="s2">difficult. How do you keep this from</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.131" end="01:00:57.617" style="s2">blowing past Naxa&#39;s budget?</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.597" end="01:00:57.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.031" end="01:01:03.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re using a new eco-friendly composite</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.831" end="01:01:05.131" style="s2">that meets every Naxa performance</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.431" end="01:01:09.031" style="s2">requirement while cutting total</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.131" end="01:01:09.031" style="s2">production costs by 15%.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.731" end="01:01:16.632" style="s2">Congratulations, Kai. The technical</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.431" end="01:01:18.732" style="s2">committee approved your proposal</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.632" end="01:01:19.832" style="s2">unanimously. You&#39;ll lead the Inaxe A bid</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.732" end="01:01:20.832" style="s2">from here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.832" end="01:01:22.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.832" end="01:01:24.132" style="s2">But this is only step one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.932" end="01:01:27.532" style="s2">Now we have to work together and</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.132" end="01:01:27.532" style="s2">actually get this thing off the ground.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.432" end="01:01:35.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.432" end="01:01:39.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey,</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.532" end="01:01:41.832" style="s2">didn&#39;t you have an international video</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.732" end="01:01:43.632" style="s2">conference tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.832" end="01:01:45.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pushed it back.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.632" end="01:01:46.832" style="s2">So, how does it feel?</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.532" end="01:01:48.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly,</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.832" end="01:01:49.732" style="s2">like I just won a war. At least all</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.732" end="01:01:50.532" style="s2">those sleepless nights weren&#39;t for</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.732" end="01:01:52.732" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.532" end="01:01:54.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t celebrate yet. Today only earned</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.732" end="01:01:55.932" style="s2">you the right to represent Barrett</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.032" end="01:01:58.732" style="s2">Group. The real competition won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.932" end="01:02:00.332" style="s2">sitting in a boardroom voting for you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.732" end="01:02:02.032" style="s2">The Inaxe A bidding officially starts</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.332" end="01:02:03.632" style="s2">tomorrow. The Prescotts have bet</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.032" end="01:02:06.032" style="s2">everything they owned on it. They&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.632" end="01:02:07.732" style="s2">whatever it takes to win.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.032" end="01:02:11.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Audrey.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.732" end="01:02:11.132" style="s2">I&#39;ve been waiting a long time for this.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.232" end="01:02:24.532" style="s2">There&#39;s my handsome boy. And don&#39;t work</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.132" end="01:02:25.832" style="s2">yourself too hard, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.532" end="01:02:28.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.832" end="01:02:28.632" style="s2">I know my limits.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:34.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I double-checked the final bid numbers I</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.432" end="01:02:36.732" style="s2">sent you last night. Everything solid?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.932" end="01:02:38.732" style="s2">Just do what you do.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.732" end="01:02:40.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Copy that, Madam CEO. I won&#39;t embarrass</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.732" end="01:02:42.532" style="s2">the Barrett name.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.232" end="01:02:42.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.732" end="01:02:47.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, your nightmare&#39;s only just</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.532" end="01:02:47.132" style="s2">beginning.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.532" end="01:02:55.332" style="s2">Well, look who crawled out of his</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.532" end="01:02:56.732" style="s2">hospital bed. Barrett Group that</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.332" end="01:02:58.132" style="s2">desperate now?</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.732" end="01:02:59.932" style="s2">They actually put you in charge of a bid</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.132" end="01:03:01.132" style="s2">this big?</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.932" end="01:03:02.532" style="s2">The Barretts are none of your business,</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.132" end="01:03:04.632" style="s2">plagiarist.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.532" end="01:03:05.732" style="s2">And damn, those bags under your eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.632" end="01:03:07.253" style="s2">What, been up all night cooking up</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.732" end="01:03:09.032" style="s2">another original design?</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.253" end="01:03:11.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.032" end="01:03:12.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.132" end="01:03:13.832" style="s2">You&#39;re the bastard who&#39;s been pulling</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.332" end="01:03:15.532" style="s2">all this [ __ ] behind my back, aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.832" end="01:03:17.533" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.532" end="01:03:18.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still have the balls to come at me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.533" end="01:03:21.133" style="s2">I just made sure everyone saw what you</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.933" end="01:03:22.833" style="s2">stole.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.133" end="01:03:23.933" style="s2">I wiped the original Mars 1 records</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.833" end="01:03:26.933" style="s2">clean.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.933" end="01:03:26.933" style="s2">How the hell did he get them?</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:31.133" style="s2">Who the hell are you to call it?</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.933" end="01:03:38.333" style="s2">You still have the balls to come at me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.933" end="01:03:40.533" style="s2">I just made sure everyone saw what you</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.333" end="01:03:42.233" style="s2">stole.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.533" end="01:03:43.333" style="s2">I wiped the original Mars 1 records</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.233" end="01:03:46.333" style="s2">clean.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.333" end="01:03:46.333" style="s2">How the hell did he get them?</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.554" end="01:03:49.033" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.333" end="01:03:51.233" style="s2">What the hell are you to call it? What</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.033" end="01:03:52.733" style="s2">Colin is to me doesn&#39;t matter. You stole</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.233" end="01:03:54.333" style="s2">his dream and climbed this high on his</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.733" end="01:03:56.233" style="s2">life&#39;s work. You should have known the</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.333" end="01:03:57.933" style="s2">fall was coming. Cut the [ __ ] When</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.233" end="01:03:59.133" style="s2">I crush Barrett Group and win this bid,</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.933" end="01:04:02.033" style="s2">the entire industry will know who the</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.133" end="01:04:02.033" style="s2">real genius is.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.133" end="01:04:05.733" style="s2">A real genius? Enjoy your last few</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:07.533" style="s2">minutes in the spotlight, Damian. When</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.733" end="01:04:10.033" style="s2">this bid is over, you&#39;ll have less than</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.533" end="01:04:10.033" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.833" end="01:04:14.533" style="s2">And that&#39;s Mercury II, developed</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.433" end="01:04:16.133" style="s2">entirely by my team. This is the future</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.533" end="01:04:18.333" style="s2">of commercial space flighting. Thank</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.133" end="01:04:18.333" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.233" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">See that loser?</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.133" end="01:04:25.433" style="s2">That&#39;s what real aerospace engineering</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:27.164" style="s2">looks like. Try not to choke when it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.433" end="01:04:29.184" style="s2">your turn.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.164" end="01:04:29.184" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.334" end="01:04:39.733" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.433" end="01:04:41.133" style="s2">Good morning. I&#39;m Kai Barrett, project</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.733" end="01:04:42.733" style="s2">lead for Barrett Group. This is</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.133" end="01:04:44.033" style="s2">Explorer, Barrett Group&#39;s next</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.733" end="01:04:46.133" style="s2">generation commercial space flight</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.033" end="01:04:48.033" style="s2">proposal for NASA. Explorer uses an all</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.133" end="01:04:49.733" style="s2">new intelligent flight control system,</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.033" end="01:04:51.233" style="s2">cutting turnaround time dramatically</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.733" end="01:04:53.533" style="s2">while bringing down the cost of every</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.233" end="01:04:54.833" style="s2">launch.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.533" end="01:04:57.233" style="s2">And it&#39;s not limited to commercial</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.833" end="01:04:59.433" style="s2">launches. After a major disaster,</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.233" end="01:05:02.033" style="s2">Explorer can rapidly deploy emergency</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.433" end="01:05:03.433" style="s2">communications infrastructure.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.033" end="01:05:06.233" style="s2">Space technology shouldn&#39;t be an</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.433" end="01:05:08.433" style="s2">expensive toy for a privileged few.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.233" end="01:05:11.133" style="s2">It should take us farther and make life</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.433" end="01:05:12.533" style="s2">better for everyone down here.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.133" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">That&#39;s our proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.533" end="01:05:14.933" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.595" end="01:05:38.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.135" end="01:05:39.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you to every company that</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.335" end="01:05:41.735" style="s2">presented today. After careful</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.935" end="01:05:43.935" style="s2">discussion and a full evaluation, the</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.735" end="01:05:46.135" style="s2">panel has reached a unanimous decision.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.935" end="01:05:49.235" style="s2">The Naxa commercial space project has</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.135" end="01:05:49.235" style="s2">been awarded to</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.135" end="01:05:55.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prescott Group.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.635" end="01:05:56.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you kidding me? How the hell did</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.335" end="01:05:58.135" style="s2">Prescott&#39;s garbage proposal beat</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.735" end="01:05:59.935" style="s2">Barrett&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.135" end="01:06:01.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s dirty here. No way that</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.935" end="01:06:04.335" style="s2">result is clean. Cameron Kai, get his</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.735" end="01:06:04.335" style="s2">reaction.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.935" end="01:06:09.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrett Group&#39;s proposal is innovative,</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.235" end="01:06:12.435" style="s2">no question. But some of the key</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.935" end="01:06:14.735" style="s2">technology is still unproven and the</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.435" end="01:06:17.335" style="s2">cost estimates are too uncertain.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.735" end="01:06:19.135" style="s2">Prescott&#39;s plan is simply the safer,</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.335" end="01:06:20.635" style="s2">more established option.</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.135" end="01:06:22.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our submission included complete</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.635" end="01:06:24.935" style="s2">simulation data, risk reports, and</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.635" end="01:06:27.935" style="s2">independent assessments. So tell me,</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.935" end="01:06:29.935" style="s2">what exactly hasn&#39;t been unproven?</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.935" end="01:06:32.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the final decision of all five</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.935" end="01:06:35.435" style="s2">experts after a comprehensive review.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.135" end="01:06:37.235" style="s2">Mr. Barrett, respect the rule.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.435" end="01:06:39.135" style="s2">Tough luck, Kai. Your proposal sure</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.235" end="01:06:40.835" style="s2">looks pretty. Too bad Naxa needs</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.135" end="01:06:42.735" style="s2">something that can actually fly, not a</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.835" end="01:06:44.335" style="s2">bunch of fancy concept art.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.735" end="01:06:45.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if you&#39;re a genius?</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.335" end="01:06:49.235" style="s2">Colin was more talented than you and he</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.935" end="01:06:52.735" style="s2">still died like a [ __ ] dog.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.235" end="01:06:52.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, you&#39;re [ __ ] dead.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.835" end="01:06:59.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if you&#39;re a genius?</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.535" end="01:07:01.635" style="s2">Colin was more talented than you and he</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.035" end="01:07:05.135" style="s2">still died like a [ __ ] dog.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.635" end="01:07:05.135" style="s2">Damian, you&#39;re [ __ ] dead.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.676" end="01:07:08.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.135" end="01:07:12.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got it. Front page material.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.735" end="01:07:16.635" style="s2">Billionaire air brawl AT THE NAXA BID.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.435" end="01:07:16.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SECURITY! HE&#39;S TRYING TO KILL ME.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.535" end="01:07:20.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody seeing [music] this? So this</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.135" end="01:07:24.036" style="s2">is how the Barretts do business?</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.935" end="01:07:25.136" style="s2">Lose a bid, start swinging? Real classy.</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.036" end="01:07:26.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian,</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.136" end="01:07:29.036" style="s2">you know exactly what dirty [ __ ] you</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.636" end="01:07:29.036" style="s2">pulled.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.236" end="01:07:35.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO THE [ __ ] TOUCHED MY SON?</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.336" end="01:07:40.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your filthy hands off my son.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.136" end="01:07:44.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kyle,</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.236" end="01:07:44.936" style="s2">are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.436" end="01:07:49.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son&#39;s actions will be handled by our</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.236" end="01:07:51.436" style="s2">attorneys.</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.836" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">But this rigged bid,</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.436" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">everyone here deserves the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.236" end="01:08:04.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Barrett Group will not recognize a bid</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.736" end="01:08:04.036" style="s2">result bought through bribery.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.136" end="01:08:08.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Barrett, that&#39;s defamation. This</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.236" end="01:08:11.136" style="s2">entire event is being recorded. You will</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.036" end="01:08:13.836" style="s2">be held responsible for that accusation.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.136" end="01:08:15.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I intend to. Every bribery</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.836" end="01:08:17.536" style="s2">record, offshore account, and backroom</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.836" end="01:08:20.836" style="s2">transaction has already been submitted</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.536" end="01:08:20.836" style="s2">to NAXA&#39;s oversight officer.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.136" end="01:08:24.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bit late for that.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.136" end="01:08:27.836" style="s2">Lockdown every exit until we get to the</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.536" end="01:08:29.517" style="s2">bottom of this. Nobody&#39;s leaving this</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.836" end="01:08:31.537" style="s2">[ __ ] room.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.517" end="01:08:31.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.736" end="01:08:34.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING? THIS IS</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.036" end="01:08:36.436" style="s2">UNLAWFUL DETENTION.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.336" end="01:08:38.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m calling the police. THIS IS INSANE.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.436" end="01:08:41.307" style="s2">YOU BARRETTS THINK YOU OWN NEW YORK?</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.936" end="01:08:43.327" style="s2">YOU CAN&#39;T JUST LOCK PEOPLE in here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.307" end="01:08:43.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.936" end="01:08:47.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you doing? THIS IS</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.136" end="01:08:49.536" style="s2">UNLAWFUL DETENTION.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.436" end="01:08:52.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;M CALLING the police. THIS IS INSANE.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.536" end="01:08:55.436" style="s2">YOU BARRETTS THINK YOU OWN NEW YORK?</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.036" end="01:08:57.436" style="s2">YOU CAN&#39;T JUST LOCK PEOPLE IN HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.436" end="01:08:58.836" style="s2">WHAT, YOU THINK YOU&#39;RE THE mob now? DOES</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.436" end="01:09:01.036" style="s2">THE LAW MEAN NOTHING TO YOU?</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.836" end="01:09:02.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE LAW? PERFECT.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.036" end="01:09:05.436" style="s2">Once we&#39;re done here, I&#39;ll call the cops</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.536" end="01:09:05.436" style="s2">for you myself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.336" end="01:09:15.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want evidence? Fine. Open your</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.336" end="01:09:15.136" style="s2">[ __ ] eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.836" end="01:09:21.936" style="s2">This is the full paper trail proving</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.336" end="01:09:24.636" style="s2">Prescott Group bribed the panel to win</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.936" end="01:09:26.538" style="s2">NAXA. Witnesses, transactions, messages,</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.636" end="01:09:27.938" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.538" end="01:09:29.737" style="s2">Mr. Davis,</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.938" end="01:09:31.237" style="s2">$3 million suddenly appeared in your</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.737" end="01:09:33.338" style="s2">eldest son&#39;s offshore account last</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.237" end="01:09:35.137" style="s2">Tuesday. Care to explain that?</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.338" end="01:09:36.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I I don&#39;t know anything about that. It</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.137" end="01:09:37.438" style="s2">has nothing to do with me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.137" end="01:09:38.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t remember?</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.438" end="01:09:41.237" style="s2">This next video should refresh your</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.838" end="01:09:41.237" style="s2">memory.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.038" end="01:09:46.137" style="s2">This next video should refresh your</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.438" end="01:09:48.137" style="s2">memory.</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.137" end="01:09:49.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Davis, that&#39;s the $3 million</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.137" end="01:09:51.838" style="s2">deposit. Just like we agreed, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.938" end="01:09:53.838" style="s2">already in your son&#39;s Cayman account.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.838" end="01:09:55.738" style="s2">Once Prescott Group wins an AXA, every</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.838" end="01:09:57.137" style="s2">materials contract goes exclusively to</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.738" end="01:09:58.738" style="s2">your nephew&#39;s company. I&#39;d say that</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.137" end="01:10:00.538" style="s2">proves how serious we are.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.738" end="01:10:04.038" style="s2">As long as the money arrives on time,</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.538" end="01:10:04.038" style="s2">Prescott Group gets the contract.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.338" end="01:10:11.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $3 million and every materials contract,</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.038" end="01:10:12.438" style="s2">they&#39;re treating AXA like their own damn</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.137" end="01:10:14.137" style="s2">company.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.438" end="01:10:15.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder the result was [ __ ] The</p>
<p begin="01:10:14.137" end="01:10:16.038" style="s2">deal was bought before we even walked</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.637" end="01:10:18.038" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.038" end="01:10:19.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is [ __ ] in shameless. The FBI</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.038" end="01:10:21.637" style="s2">needs to investigate every last one of</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.438" end="01:10:21.637" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.038" end="01:10:25.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you the right to lock us in</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.338" end="01:10:27.238" style="s2">here? You lose the bid, so now you fake</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.438" end="01:10:28.738" style="s2">evidence and hold everyone hostage? You</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.238" end="01:10:31.438" style="s2">think the Barretts own this city?</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.738" end="01:10:33.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. You&#39;re just bitter Damian one.</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.438" end="01:10:34.738" style="s2">You&#39;re jealous because he&#39;s the real</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.137" end="01:10:37.238" style="s2">genius here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.738" end="01:10:37.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call in.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.438" end="01:10:43.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian&#39;s talent,</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.137" end="01:10:44.637" style="s2">his [music] only talent is theft.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.038" end="01:10:46.338" style="s2">He bled his own brother dry, stole his</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.637" end="01:10:47.338" style="s2">design, stole the credit, ruined his</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.338" end="01:10:50.738" style="s2">life,</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.338" end="01:10:50.738" style="s2">and wore it all like it was his.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.438" end="01:10:57.738" style="s2">He bled his own brother dry, stole his</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.038" end="01:10:58.738" style="s2">design, stole the credit, ruined his</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.738" end="01:11:02.137" style="s2">life,</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.738" end="01:11:02.137" style="s2">then wore it all like it was his.</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.938" end="01:11:07.338" style="s2">Stealing someone else&#39;s life and work,</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.038" end="01:11:08.438" style="s2">that&#39;s your talent?</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.338" end="01:11:10.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.438" end="01:11:11.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, listen. Maybe there were</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.038" end="01:11:13.738" style="s2">mistakes in the process, but the bid</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.637" end="01:11:16.637" style="s2">comes down to the proposal. My son won</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.738" end="01:11:18.438" style="s2">because his work was better.</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.637" end="01:11:20.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai is digging up old dirt and smearing</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.438" end="01:11:21.838" style="s2">people all you know how to do?</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.938" end="01:11:23.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.838" end="01:11:25.038" style="s2">I borrowed a few ideas from my brother</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.238" end="01:11:27.238" style="s2">early on, but 4 years later, the AXA</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.038" end="01:11:29.039" style="s2">design is ours. Every core system, every</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.238" end="01:11:29.439" style="s2">spec my team built from scratch under my</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.039" end="01:11:30.739" style="s2">lead.</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.439" end="01:11:32.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under your lead?</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.739" end="01:11:33.739" style="s2">You sure?</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.439" end="01:11:35.039" style="s2">Telling a lie this big in front of all</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.739" end="01:11:38.139" style="s2">these people,</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.039" end="01:11:38.139" style="s2">you really sleep okay at night?</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.739" end="01:11:45.539" style="s2">Take a look. On the left is the design</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.539" end="01:11:47.339" style="s2">Damian submitted today. On the right is</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.539" end="01:11:49.839" style="s2">Colin Prescott&#39;s original, never</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.339" end="01:11:51.339" style="s2">published draft from four years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.839" end="01:11:55.039" style="s2">From the separation system to the</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.339" end="01:11:56.139" style="s2">propulsion design, they&#39;re a 99% match.</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.039" end="01:11:58.739" style="s2">Damian, last time you called it a</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.139" end="01:12:00.039" style="s2">creative coincidence. So what is this?</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.739" end="01:12:01.839" style="s2">Another coincidence?</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.039" end="01:12:04.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the parameter notes and revision</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.839" end="01:12:06.939" style="s2">marks match. That&#39;s copy paste.</p>
<p begin="01:12:04.339" end="01:12:08.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Colin&#39;s a Prescott, too. Why was</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.939" end="01:12:09.239" style="s2">Damian the one taking all the awards and</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.139" end="01:12:10.039" style="s2">pitching the project? Where the hell is</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.239" end="01:12:11.539" style="s2">Colin?</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.039" end="01:12:13.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it not obvious? They stole the older</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.539" end="01:12:14.839" style="s2">son&#39;s work to prop up the younger one.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.039" end="01:12:17.039" style="s2">Bunch of [ __ ] leeches.</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.839" end="01:12:19.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Chairman Prescott, enough hiding</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.039" end="01:12:22.939" style="s2">him. Bring out your real genius son. Let</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.939" end="01:12:22.939" style="s2">us meet Colin.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.339" end="01:12:36.239" style="s2">Hey, Chairman Prescott, enough hiding</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.339" end="01:12:37.765" style="s2">him. Bring out your real genius son. Let</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.239" end="01:12:38.339" style="s2">us meet Colin.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.765" end="01:12:39.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.339" end="01:12:40.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin hasn&#39;t been well lately. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.639" end="01:12:42.539" style="s2">resting at home. This is a business bid,</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.939" end="01:12:44.439" style="s2">not Prescott family party.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.539" end="01:12:46.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get somebody to sketch up some crap,</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.439" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">FAKE A DATE, AND SUDDENLY MY BROTHER&#39;S</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.239" end="01:12:48.839" style="s2">GUILTY?</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.239" end="01:12:50.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EXACTLY. WHERE THE [ __ ] DID YOU DIG UP</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.839" end="01:12:51.439" style="s2">those fake blueprints? You&#39;re trying to</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.239" end="01:12:52.339" style="s2">ruin me, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.439" end="01:12:54.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fake?</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.339" end="01:12:55.939" style="s2">Please. I don&#39;t need fake evidence to</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.339" end="01:12:57.039" style="s2">bury you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.939" end="01:12:58.739" style="s2">Let me introduce Professor Miller from</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.039" end="01:13:00.139" style="s2">Columbia Engineering. He served as a</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.739" end="01:13:01.939" style="s2">technical mentor for the National Youth</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.139" end="01:13:03.839" style="s2">Aerospace Innovation Competition. He can</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.939" end="01:13:05.539" style="s2">tell us who these drafts belong to.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.839" end="01:13:07.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.539" end="01:13:08.639" style="s2">The way the parameters are labeled, the</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:10.439" style="s2">logic behind the propulsion system,</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.639" end="01:13:11.739" style="s2">especially that hidden E-shaped market</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.439" end="01:13:13.339" style="s2">joint,</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.739" end="01:13:15.139" style="s2">that boy was a real genius. Such a</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.339" end="01:13:17.939" style="s2">waste. I would stake my professional</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.139" end="01:13:19.239" style="s2">reputation on it. The true designer,</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.939" end="01:13:20.739" style="s2">Colin Prescott.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.239" end="01:13:21.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian deleted Colin&#39;s visible</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.739" end="01:13:23.339" style="s2">signature.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.839" end="01:13:25.339" style="s2">What he forgot was the hidden layer in</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.339" end="01:13:26.939" style="s2">the original file. The metamade is still</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.339" end="01:13:28.939" style="s2">shows the original creator and the</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.939" end="01:13:30.139" style="s2">creation date from four years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.939" end="01:13:31.640" style="s2">Damian,</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.139" end="01:13:32.740" style="s2">you were too [ __ ] lazy to even steal</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.640" end="01:13:35.040" style="s2">it well.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.740" end="01:13:36.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even Professor Miller came forward. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.040" end="01:13:38.140" style="s2">a legend in engineering.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.540" end="01:13:40.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Prescott, the evidence is staring</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.140" end="01:13:41.340" style="s2">you in the face. Why not get Colin on a</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.040" end="01:13:43.840" style="s2">video call and settle this?</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.340" end="01:13:45.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t bother calling him.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.840" end="01:13:48.340" style="s2">Colin</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.140" end="01:13:51.640" style="s2">is never going to show up again.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.340" end="01:13:51.640" style="s2">Colin is never coming back.</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.781" end="01:13:53.801" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.840" end="01:13:57.840" style="s2">Did everyone forget Colin Prescott,</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.540" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">their own son, their own blood, the son</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.840" end="01:14:02.440" style="s2">they erased, his parents, his sister,</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.540" end="01:14:04.240" style="s2">and the adopted son who stole his place,</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.440" end="01:14:05.640" style="s2">drove him to his death? They locked him</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.240" end="01:14:07.240" style="s2">in a basement like a dog, left him there</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.640" end="01:14:07.640" style="s2">to die, then dumped his body in the</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.240" end="01:14:09.040" style="s2">river.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.640" end="01:14:12.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP! YOU LOST THE BID, SO NOW YOU&#39;RE</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.040" end="01:14:12.240" style="s2">MAKING UP THIS [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.940" end="01:14:17.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A WEEK AGO, POLICE FOUND human remains</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.940" end="01:14:18.740" style="s2">in the Hudson after an anonymous tip.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.140" end="01:14:20.840" style="s2">DNA confirmed</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.740" end="01:14:22.740" style="s2">the remains belonged to Colin Prescott.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.840" end="01:14:24.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] Every [ __ ] bit of it is</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.740" end="01:14:25.940" style="s2">fake. You&#39;re trying to destroy the</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.140" end="01:14:28.440" style="s2">Prescott family with this sick setup.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.940" end="01:14:31.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. No, I didn&#39;t mean to. I NEVER MEANT</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.440" end="01:14:33.140" style="s2">FOR HIM TO DIE. WARREN, SAY SOMETHING.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.040" end="01:14:34.740" style="s2">YOU WERE HOME THAT NIGHT, TOO. YOU KNEW.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.140" end="01:14:37.040" style="s2">You knew he was coughing UP BLOOD IN</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.740" end="01:14:38.540" style="s2">THAT BASEMENT.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.040" end="01:14:40.140" style="s2">YOU KNEW HE WAS COUGHING UP BLOOD IN</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.540" end="01:14:41.940" style="s2">THAT BASEMENT.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.140" end="01:14:43.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT THE [ __ ] UP, YOU CRAZY [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.940" end="01:14:45.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LYDIA, maybe you never meant to kill</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.240" end="01:14:47.240" style="s2">him, but someone here wanted Colin dead</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.140" end="01:14:48.440" style="s2">from the very beginning.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.240" end="01:14:50.340" style="s2">Those snakes didn&#39;t just show up at the</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.440" end="01:14:52.840" style="s2">Prescott house by accident. That was</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.340" end="01:14:54.140" style="s2">attempted murder. And you, Lydia, Colin</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.840" end="01:14:56.340" style="s2">begged you through that door over and</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.140" end="01:14:57.840" style="s2">over, and you still walked away.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.340" end="01:14:59.240" style="s2">He was down there coughing up blood,</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.840" end="01:15:02.940" style="s2">fighting to breathe until he died, and</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.240" end="01:15:02.940" style="s2">you couldn&#39;t even open the [ __ ] door.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.440" end="01:15:13.940" style="s2">You didn&#39;t just steal a few goddamn</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.940" end="01:15:16.140" style="s2">blueprints from him. You stole his</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.940" end="01:15:17.640" style="s2">family, his dreams, [music] and in the</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.140" end="01:15:19.940" style="s2">end, you even stole his chance to stay</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.640" end="01:15:21.840" style="s2">alive. You took HIS WHOLE [ __ ] LIFE.</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.940" end="01:15:24.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] MONSTER. YOU DESTROYED YOUR</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.840" end="01:15:24.540" style="s2">OWN SON.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.240" end="01:15:30.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PLAGIARISM, BRIBERY, and you [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.040" end="01:15:32.740" style="s2">killed your own son? What kind of</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.340" end="01:15:34.642" style="s2">monsters ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.740" end="01:15:37.942" style="s2">THE PRESCOTTS are a [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.642" end="01:15:40.242" style="s2">to this industry. Go to hell.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.942" end="01:15:42.442" style="s2">You piece of [ __ ] You stole his work</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.242" end="01:15:43.342" style="s2">and then took his life. Go be A GENIUS</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.442" end="01:15:45.342" style="s2">IN HELL.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.342" end="01:15:46.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET AWAY FROM ME. DON&#39;T TOUCH ME. DON&#39;T</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.342" end="01:15:47.342" style="s2">TOUCH MY CHANEL. DO YOU KNOW WHO MY</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.542" end="01:15:49.442" style="s2">LAWYER IS?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.342" end="01:15:50.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SECURITY. THIS IS A [ __ ] RIOT.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.442" end="01:15:54.142" style="s2">THEY&#39;RE TRYING TO KILL US.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.942" end="01:15:56.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; POLICE. Nobody move.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.142" end="01:15:56.942" style="s2">Warren Prescott, Damian Prescott, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.042" end="01:15:58.442" style="s2">under arrest on suspicion of</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.942" end="01:15:59.042" style="s2">first-degree murder, commercial bribery,</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.442" end="01:16:01.342" style="s2">and fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.042" end="01:16:04.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, IT WASN&#39;T ME. I DIDN&#39;T KILL HIM. MY</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.342" end="01:16:04.042" style="s2">DAD DID IT.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.242" end="01:16:10.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN,</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.542" end="01:16:12.942" style="s2">MOMMY WAS WRONG. It was so cold down</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.642" end="01:16:15.942" style="s2">there, wasn&#39;t it? Come back. Mommy will</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.942" end="01:16:15.942" style="s2">get you some water.</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.542" end="01:16:21.242" style="s2">Colin, Colin, it&#39;s you, isn&#39;t it? Mommy</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.342" end="01:16:22.742" style="s2">was wrong. Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.242" end="01:16:24.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the wrong person. Colin</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.742" end="01:16:26.042" style="s2">Prescott died in that Cold River a long</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.442" end="01:16:29.042" style="s2">time ago. I am Kai Barrett.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.042" end="01:16:30.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, it&#39;s you. You&#39;re my Colin. Please</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.042" end="01:16:32.142" style="s2">just let mom hold you.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.942" end="01:16:34.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late.</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.142" end="01:16:36.442" style="s2">Maybe this is your punishment. Take her</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.042" end="01:16:36.442" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.342" end="01:16:43.042" style="s2">Colin, you can rest now. It &#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.142" end="01:16:48.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Warren Prescott and his adopted son</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.042" end="01:16:50.942" style="s2">Damian have been sentenced to life</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.742" end="01:16:52.742" style="s2">without parole for murder and fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.942" end="01:16:55.442" style="s2">Prescott Group has officially declared</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.742" end="01:16:55.442" style="s2">bankruptcy.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.342" end="01:17:02.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina, the company&#39;s bankrupt. What about</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.442" end="01:17:04.142" style="s2">all the money we invested? Your father</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.142" end="01:17:05.542" style="s2">personally guaranteed our returns.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.142" end="01:17:07.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company&#39;s already liquidating its</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.542" end="01:17:09.042" style="s2">assets. I&#39;ll do everything I can.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.542" end="01:17:10.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your whole family&#39;s a bunch of [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.042" end="01:17:11.942" style="s2">frauds. Your father and brother killed</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.642" end="01:17:14.242" style="s2">someone, and now we&#39;re supposed to pay</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.942" end="01:17:15.742" style="s2">for their crimes?</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.242" end="01:17:17.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s a legal notice. Those debts you</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.742" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">personally guaranteed, you&#39;re paying</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.242" end="01:17:20.842" style="s2">every damn cent or we&#39;ll see you in</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.742" end="01:17:22.142" style="s2">court.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.842" end="01:17:23.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.142" end="01:17:25.042" style="s2">Just give me a little more time.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.842" end="01:17:27.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still think you&#39;re some trusted</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.042" end="01:17:30.542" style="s2">princess? Wake the [ __ ] out. Your</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.642" end="01:17:30.542" style="s2">family&#39;s finished.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.142" end="01:17:39.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New evidence reviews of abuse Colin</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.043" end="01:17:41.143" style="s2">Prescott suffered at the hands of his</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.743" end="01:17:43.343" style="s2">own family.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.143" end="01:17:45.243" style="s2">Investigators confirmed that Colin, once</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.343" end="01:17:47.743" style="s2">branded a thief and a liar by his own</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.243" end="01:17:49.243" style="s2">family, was actually a gifted aerospace</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.743" end="01:17:51.143" style="s2">engineer.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.243" end="01:17:53.943" style="s2">His adopted brother Damian had framed</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.143" end="01:17:53.943" style="s2">him repeatedly.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.343" end="01:17:59.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina, I didn&#39;t steal anything. Please,</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.743" end="01:18:02.443" style="s2">you have to believe me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.943" end="01:18:05.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Damian would never frame you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.443" end="01:18:07.143" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a lying little thief.</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.743" end="01:18:08.543" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.143" end="01:18:10.943" style="s2">you really were telling the truth all</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.543" end="01:18:10.943" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.043" end="01:18:16.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Prescott, the auction of your family</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.743" end="01:18:17.943" style="s2">estate has been finalized.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.943" end="01:18:19.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.943" end="01:18:20.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; However, we found some personal</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.143" end="01:18:21.643" style="s2">belongings in the basement while</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.243" end="01:18:22.843" style="s2">clearing out the house. We need you to</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.643" end="01:18:24.143" style="s2">come by and confirm whether you&#39;d like</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.843" end="01:18:25.143" style="s2">to keep them.</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.143" end="01:18:27.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.143" end="01:18:27.843" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right there.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.914" end="01:18:45.934" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.243" end="01:18:53.543" style="s2">Colin,</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.443" end="01:18:53.543" style="s2">you lived in this place all those years?</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.543" end="01:19:07.743" style="s2">God, this place is disgusting. How can</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.043" end="01:19:09.143" style="s2">you even live in this dump?</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.743" end="01:19:10.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina,</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.143" end="01:19:12.043" style="s2">I already cleaned up.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.243" end="01:19:13.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call me your sister. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.043" end="01:19:15.943" style="s2">embarrassed enough having you as a</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.443" end="01:19:15.943" style="s2">brother.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.385" end="01:19:36.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.443" end="01:19:36.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear Tina, happy birthday.</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.943" end="01:19:41.344" style="s2">It&#39;s been five years since we became a</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.744" end="01:19:41.344" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.545" end="01:19:48.545" style="s2">I know I get on your nerves a lot.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.744" end="01:19:49.945" style="s2">And I can&#39;t afford expensive gifts like</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.545" end="01:19:52.344" style="s2">Damian can.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.945" end="01:19:55.144" style="s2">But I&#39;m still so lucky to have you as my</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.344" end="01:19:57.344" style="s2">big sister.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.144" end="01:20:00.445" style="s2">I know you think I&#39;m a nobody,</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.344" end="01:20:01.744" style="s2">but I&#39;ll keep trying to make you proud.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.445" end="01:20:04.045" style="s2">One day,</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.744" end="01:20:07.945" style="s2">when I become an aerospace engineer,</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.045" end="01:20:07.945" style="s2">I&#39;ll name my first satellite after you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.945" end="01:20:13.344" style="s2">That way, wherever you go, you can look</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.545" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">up at the sky</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.344" end="01:20:17.545" style="s2">and know there&#39;s a star up there with</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.744" end="01:20:17.545" style="s2">your name on it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.644" end="01:20:23.545" style="s2">I hope you&#39;ll always be happy, Tina.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.545" end="01:20:26.945" style="s2">No matter what happens,</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.545" end="01:20:26.945" style="s2">I&#39;ll always wish you the best.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.445" end="01:20:36.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin?</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.744" end="01:20:38.844" style="s2">You stupid, stupid boy.</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.344" end="01:20:40.344" style="s2">I treated you like [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.844" end="01:20:42.644" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.344" end="01:20:45.045" style="s2">Why were you still so good to me?</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.644" end="01:20:46.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina, I didn&#39;t steal anything. Please,</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.045" end="01:20:47.045" style="s2">you have to believe me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.144" end="01:20:48.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.045" end="01:20:52.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina,</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.644" end="01:20:52.144" style="s2">please just believe me this once.</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.344" end="01:20:58.344" style="s2">Tina, please help me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.644" end="01:21:05.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Colin. I was wrong. I was so</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.144" end="01:21:07.545" style="s2">wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.545" end="01:21:10.045" style="s2">You never stole anything.</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.545" end="01:21:13.256" style="s2">You never lied.</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.045" end="01:21:15.545" style="s2">You never hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.256" end="01:21:19.861" style="s2">[gasps] I was the monster.</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.545" end="01:21:19.861" style="s2">It was me all along. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.631" end="01:21:33.844" style="s2">[sighs] Tina,</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.545" end="01:21:37.144" style="s2">did you find Colin?</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.844" end="01:21:37.144" style="s2">Is he still mad at me?</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.045" end="01:21:41.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.744" end="01:21:43.446" style="s2">tell him I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.945" end="01:21:45.745" style="s2">Tell him he&#39;ll never have to live in</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.446" end="01:21:48.345" style="s2">that basement again.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.745" end="01:21:51.646" style="s2">I&#39;ll do anything he wants</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.345" end="01:21:51.646" style="s2">if he&#39;ll just come home.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.245" end="01:21:57.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.046" end="01:21:58.345" style="s2">Colin&#39;s never coming home.</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.141" end="01:21:59.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.345" end="01:22:02.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No,</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.446" end="01:22:02.345" style="s2">that&#39;s not true.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.946" end="01:22:07.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin left this for me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.745" end="01:22:10.446" style="s2">Even at the very end, he still wanted me</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.646" end="01:22:10.446" style="s2">to be happy.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.946" end="01:22:22.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was so kind.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.845" end="01:22:26.345" style="s2">He loved us so much.</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.546" end="01:22:26.345" style="s2">And we never believed a word he said.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.245" end="01:22:36.146" style="s2">He used to</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.646" end="01:22:36.146" style="s2">write little notes for me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.245" end="01:22:42.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy Mother&#39;s Day, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.946" end="01:22:42.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just leave it on the table.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.446" end="01:22:47.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.245" end="01:22:49.946" style="s2">could we have dinner together tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.646" end="01:22:52.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you see I&#39;m busy? Maybe some other</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.946" end="01:22:53.646" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.546" end="01:22:55.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay,</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.646" end="01:22:55.845" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.946" end="01:23:05.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I always thought</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.046" end="01:23:08.146" style="s2">we&#39;d have more time.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.745" end="01:23:10.646" style="s2">I thought once he grew up,</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.146" end="01:23:12.546" style="s2">once he stopped upsetting me,</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.646" end="01:23:15.046" style="s2">we could finally be a normal mother and</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.546" end="01:23:15.046" style="s2">son.</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.646" end="01:23:21.046" style="s2">We could finally be a normal mother and</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.546" end="01:23:21.046" style="s2">son.</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.745" end="01:23:27.946" style="s2">But I never thought</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.745" end="01:23:27.946" style="s2">he&#39;d be gone before we got that chance.</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.345" end="01:23:32.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.546" end="01:23:34.146" style="s2">we were so wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.946" end="01:23:36.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina,</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.146" end="01:23:37.745" style="s2">what if</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.146" end="01:23:39.546" style="s2">what if we treated Colin better from the</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.745" end="01:23:40.946" style="s2">day we brought him home?</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.546" end="01:23:42.345" style="s2">What if I&#39;d never sent him to that</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.946" end="01:23:45.046" style="s2">basement?</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.345" end="01:23:49.347" style="s2">Never believed Damian&#39;s lies.</p>
<p begin="01:23:45.046" end="01:23:49.347" style="s2">Would he Would he still be alive?</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.802" end="01:23:51.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.947" end="01:23:56.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I could do it all over again,</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.847" end="01:24:00.747" style="s2">I&#39;d give him all the love he deserved.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.647" end="01:24:10.147" style="s2">Colin,</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.247" end="01:24:10.147" style="s2">Mommy misses you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.547" end="01:24:19.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After Explorer&#39;s first commercial</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.147" end="01:24:22.147" style="s2">mission, I put your name before the</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.647" end="01:24:23.747" style="s2">board. The vote came back unanimous.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.147" end="01:24:26.947" style="s2">Starting today, you&#39;re running Barrett</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.747" end="01:24:28.347" style="s2">Group, Mr. CEO.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.947" end="01:24:29.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Audrey.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.347" end="01:24:30.847" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t be here if you hadn&#39;t taken</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.447" end="01:24:32.547" style="s2">so many hits for me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.847" end="01:24:34.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the mushy stuff.</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.547" end="01:24:37.147" style="s2">Get the stock up another 10 points, then</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.547" end="01:24:37.147" style="s2">we&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.947" end="01:24:46.447" style="s2">Did you see the Prescott verdict? Warren</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.747" end="01:24:48.647" style="s2">and Damian were convicted of murder,</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.447" end="01:24:50.147" style="s2">life without parole. Prescott Group got</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.647" end="01:24:51.747" style="s2">liquidated, too. The bank even took</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.147" end="01:24:53.047" style="s2">their mansion. Tina is the only one</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.747" end="01:24:54.747" style="s2">left, and there&#39;s no way she can keep</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.047" end="01:24:55.947" style="s2">that family afloat. I heard she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.747" end="01:24:58.647" style="s2">drowning in debt and hiding from</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.947" end="01:25:00.147" style="s2">creditors in some cheap motel. Crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.647" end="01:25:03.047" style="s2">They used to think they owned the city.</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.147" end="01:25:03.047" style="s2">Now they&#39;ve got nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.947" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kai, come on. Dinner&#39;s ready. Your dad</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.947" end="01:25:18.147" style="s2">made your favorite steak.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.347" end="01:25:39.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard you both got life. How&#39;s prison</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.447" end="01:25:39.947" style="s2">treating you?</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.547" end="01:25:43.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Barrett,</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.947" end="01:25:46.747" style="s2">you came to get us out, right? Please,</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.447" end="01:25:47.948" style="s2">help me. Name your price, anything.</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.747" end="01:25:50.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Price?</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.948" end="01:25:52.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Prescotts still have money?</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.249" end="01:25:54.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ] you, you son of a [ __ ] I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.049" end="01:25:55.349" style="s2">[ __ ] kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.249" end="01:25:56.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill me?</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.349" end="01:25:59.849" style="s2">You already did.</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.649" end="01:25:59.849" style="s2">God just gave me another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.749" end="01:26:05.448" style="s2">Spend the rest of your lives in here</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.149" end="01:26:05.448" style="s2">paying back what you owe Colin.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.948" end="01:26:12.149" style="s2">Goodbye, father.</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.849" end="01:26:12.149" style="s2">And goodbye my dear little brother.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.049" end="01:26:15.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE COLIN!</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.049" end="01:26:25.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLIN?</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.749" end="01:26:29.749" style="s2">If only I could start all over again.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.049" end="01:26:37.649" style="s2">I&#39;d never let you suffer again.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.275" end="01:26:51.949" style="s2">[gasps and snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.929" end="01:26:51.949" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.349" end="01:26:58.049" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.149" end="01:26:58.049" style="s2">Am I back 5 years in the past?</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.749" end="01:27:10.849" style="s2">Colin?</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.235" end="01:27:13.749" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.849" end="01:27:13.749" style="s2">My baby boy.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.249" end="01:27:26.049" style="s2">I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.249" end="01:27:26.049" style="s2">Mommy took so long to find you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.649" end="01:27:33.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.649" end="01:27:33.549" style="s2">I finally found you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.948" end="01:27:37.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll never let anyone hurt you again.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.049" end="01:27:47.149" style="s2">So you&#39;re Colin.</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.549" end="01:27:49.750" style="s2">I&#39;m Tina.</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.149" end="01:27:52.050" style="s2">Your big sister.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.750" end="01:27:52.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tina.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.950" end="01:28:08.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, Colin. From now on, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.750" end="01:28:11.150" style="s2">part of the Prescott family.</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.050" end="01:28:11.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, big brother.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.850" end="01:28:16.650" style="s2">Dad.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.050" end="01:28:18.950" style="s2">Mom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.650" end="01:28:18.950" style="s2">Tina.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.631" end="01:28:26.350" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.950" end="01:28:26.350" style="s2">I finally have a family.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.450" end="01:28:47.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Colin, this time I&#39;ll protect you. I</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.350" end="01:28:50.350" style="s2">won&#39;t let anyone lay a finger on you</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.650" end="01:28:50.350" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.691" end="01:28:57.711" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
